<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Luka</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt">Luka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kan zînga thil lo thleng chanchin, a tîr aṭanga mita hmutute leh thu rawngbâwltuten min hrilh chhâwn ang kha, mi tam takin ziak chhuah an tum ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chuvângin, Theofil zahawm ber, a bul aṭangin engkim ngun takin keimah ngeiin ka chhui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />mumal nei deuhvin ziaksak che ila a ṭha ang ka ti a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />an thu zirtîr che kha a dikzia i hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judai rama Heroda a lal lai khân Abija pâwla mi puithiam pakhat, a hming Zakaria a awm a; a nupui chu Arona thlah zînga mi a ni a, a hming chu Elizabeti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An pahnih chuan Pathian mit hmuha mi fel an ni a, sawisêlbova Lalpa thupêkte leh a Dân zawng zawng zâwm mi an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, Elizabeti chu a chin avangin fa an nei thei lo va, anmahni pawh an upa tawh hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An pâwl rawngbâwl huna Pathian hmaa puithiam hna a thawh ve lai chuan, puithiamte tih dân pângngai angin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tempul chhûnga lûta, rimtui hâltu tûr ṭhumvâwra an en chu a chungah a tla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rimtui a hâl lai chuan mipui zawng zawng chu pâwnah an ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Rimtui hâlna maichâm ding lama dingin Lalpa tirh vântirhkoh pakhat a hnênah a rawn inlâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zakarian a hmuh chuan a phu zawk a, a hlau ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela vântirhkoh chuan, “Zakari, hlau suh, i ṭawngṭaina chu hriat a ni e. I nupui Elizabeti chuan fapa a hrinsak ang che, a hmingah Johana i sa dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang lâwmin i hlim ang a, mi tam tak pawh a lo pian avângin an lâwm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa ngaihin mi lian a ni ang a, uain leh zu a in tûr a ni lo va; a nu pum chhûng aṭang rêngin Thlarau Thianghlimin a khat ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel thlahte zînga mi tam tak chu Lalpa an Pathian lamah a hawi kîrtîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pate chu an fate ngaihsaktîr tûr te, mi tihmawhte chu mi felte rilru put ang pu tûr te, Lalpa tâna mite inpeih tûra lo buatsaih tûrtein Elija thlarau dawn leh a thiltihtheihna neiin Lalpa hmaah chuan a lo kal hmasa dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vântirhkoh hnênah Zakaria chuan, “Chu chu engtin nge ka hriat chian theih ang? Kei putar ka ni a, ka nupui pawh a upa hle tawh si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vântirhkoh chuan, “Kei hi Pathian hmaa ding ṭhîn Gabriela ka nih hi, nangmah be tûr leh chûng thu lâwmawm chu hrilh tûr che-a tirh ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai rawh, a hun taka lo thleng ngei tûr thil ka sawite hi i awih lo vei a, a lo thlen tak tak hma chu i ngawi reng ang a, ṭawng pawh i ṭawng thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mipui chuan Zakaria chu an lo nghâk ṭhuap a. Tempul chhûnga chuti chen chen a awm ta chu mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A lo chhuah chuan an hnênah eng mah a sawi thei lo va, Tempul chhûngah inlârna a hmu a ni tih an hre ta a; an hnênah zaizirin thu a sawi a, a ṭawng thei ta hauh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A rawngbâwl hun bi a lo kim tâk hnu chuan in lamah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chûng hnu chuan a nupui Elizabeti chuan nau a pai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Mi zînga ka hming chhia chhilh nân Lalpan mi khawngaih a, heti hian mi tihsak ta,” a ti a. Thla nga a inkhûrkhung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A thla ruknaah chuan Galili rama khaw pakhat Nazaret an tiha awm, nula thianghlim pakhat, Davida thlaha mi, Josefa nupui hual hnênah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathianin vântirhkoh Gabriela chu a tîr a; chu nula hming chu Mari a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Inah chuan a va lût a, a hnênah, “Chibai, vohbîk, Lalpa i hnênah a awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A thu sawi chuan a timangang ta êm êm a, a chibai bûkna chu eng tihna tak ni ang maw tiin a inngaihtuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vântirhkoh chuan, “Mari, hlau suh, Pathian duhsakna i dawng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngai teh, nau i pai ang a, fapa i hring ang; a hmingah Isua sa ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani chu mi ropui tak a la ni ang a, Chungnungbera Fapa an ti ang; Lalpa Pathianin a thlahtu Davida lalṭhutthlêngah a ṭhuttîr ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jakoba thlahte chungah chatuanin a lal ang, a ramin kin ni a nei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mari chuan Vântirhkoh hnênah, “Pasal ka la nei si lo va, engtin nge ni ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vântirhkoh chuan a chhâng a, “Thlarau Thianghlim chu i chungah a lo awm ang a, Chungnungbera thiltihtheihna chuan a hliahkhuh ang che; chuvângin, nau lo piang tûr chu mi thianghlim, Pathian Fapa an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, i laichînnu, a ching an tih ṭhin, Elizabeti pawhin a tar hnuin mipa a pai ta, tûn thla hi a thla rukna a ni tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pathian thuchhuak rêng rêngin tih theih loh a nei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mari chuan, “Ngai teh, Lalpa bawihnu ka ni, i thu ang chuan ka chungah lo thleng rawh se,” a ti a, vântirhkoh chuan a kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Mari chu a tho va, tlângrama Juda-ho khaw pakhat panin a chho ta vang vang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Zakaria in a han thlenga, Elizabeti chu chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mari chibai bûkna aw chu a hriatin a pum chhûnga nautê chu a lo chê a. Elizabeti chu Thlarau Thianghlimin a khat a, ring takin a au va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Nang hi hmeichhia azawngah i vânnei ber e; i rîla rah pawh a vânnei e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Engtizia kher nge ka Lalpa nu ka hnênah i lo kal le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ngai teh, i chibai bûkna aw ka hriat veleh a lâwm avângin nautê pawh ka pum chhûngah a che asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />I hnêna Lalpain thu a sawi kha a thleng ngei dâwn tih i rin avângin i nihlawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Marin, “Thinlung takin Lalpa ka chawimawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Min chhandamtu Pathian chungah ka lâwm êm êm a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A bawihnu tlâwm tak hi a rawn ngaihsak a. Ngai rawh, tûn chinah chuan ṭhangthar zêl pawhin nihlawh min ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Thiltitheia khân thil ropui tak min tihsak ta. A hming pawh a thianghlim e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A khawngaihna chu ṭhang lo thar zêl thlengin Amah ṭihtute tân a dai ngai lâwng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A bânin a chakzia a lantîr a, thinlunga chapote chu a vai darh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />An ṭhutthlênga lal ṭhute chu a hnûk thla a, Rethei daikilkâra mite a chawi kâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Rilṭâmte chu thil tui tinrêngin a hrai tlai a, hausate erawh chu kut ruakin a kaltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Min thlahtute hnêna a tiam ang khân a chhiahhlawh Israel-te pui tûrin a lo thawk ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Abrahama leh a thlahte a khawngaihna kha kumkhuain a hre reng a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Mari chu thla thum lai a châm a, a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Elizabeti nau hrin chu a lo hun ta a, fapa a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />A ṭhenawmte leh a laichînte chuan Lalpan a khawngaihzia an hriat chuan an lâwmpui hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />A ni riat ni chuan nausên serh tan tûrin an lo kal khâwm a, nau hmingah a pa hming vêk, Zakaria, sak an tum a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />mahse, a nu chuan, “Ni lo ve, Johana sak tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Anni chuan, “I laichînte zîngah he hming pu hi tu mah an awm hlei nêm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />A pa chu a hmingah eng nge sak a duh tih zaizirin an zâwt ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Ani chuan ziakna phêk a han dîl a, “A hming chu Johana a ni,” tiin a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />An za chuan mak an ti hle a. Chu veleh a ka leh a lei chu phelh a lo ni ta nghâl a. Pathian fakin a lo ṭawng chhuak thei leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />An ṭhenawm zawng zawng chuan an hlau va, chûng thu chu Judai tlângramah chuan an sawi ta huai huai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />A hria apiang chuan an ngaihven a. “Chu nau chu engtin tak la awm ang maw!” an ti a. Lalpa pawhin amah a awmpui zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />A pa Zakaria chu Thlarau Thianghlimin a lo khat a, heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />“Lalpa, Israel-te Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se, A mite tlawhin a rawn tlan ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh Davida chhûngte zîngah Kan tân chhandamtu ropui tak a din ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Hmânlai zâwlnei thianghlimte kâa A sawi tawh ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Kan hmêlmate leh min hawtute laka Min humtu tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Min thlahtute a khawngaihzia a tilang a, a thuthlung thianghlim a hre reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Kan pu Abrahama hnênah thu a tiam tlat a, kan hmêlmate laka min chhan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Thlaphâng lova a rawng kan bâwla, Kan dam chhûng zawng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />A hmaa thianghlim leh fel taka kan awm a tiam kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Mama, nang zawng chungnungbera zâwlnei i ni ang a, Lalpa kawng buatsaihin i kal hmasa dâwn a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />An sualte ngaidamin a mite a chhandam tih hriattîr tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Kan Pathian khawngaihna nasa tak avâng hian chung lam ni chhuak chuan mi rawn tlawh dâwn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Thih hlau rêng rênga awmte leh thim zînga ṭhute chhun ênga, Thlamuanna kawnga kan kête pêntîr tûrin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Nausên chu a lo ṭhang lian a, thlarau lamah a lo puitling deuh deuh va, Israel mipui hmuha a rawn lan hma kha chuan thlalêrah a awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Kaisara, Augasta chuan khawvêl zawng zawnga mite hming ziak vek tûrin thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chu chu Suria ram awptu Kurinia a nih laia chhiarpui hmasa ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, mi zawng zawng mahni khua ṭheuhvah hming ziak tûrin an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Josefa pawh, Davida chhûngte leh a thlah a nih avângin, Galili ram Nazaret khua aṭang chuan, a nupui hual Mari, rit tawh tak nên chuan, hming ziak tûrin Judai rama Davida khua Bethlehem an tihah chuan an kal ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuta an awm lai chuan a hrin a lo hun ta a; fa tîrah mipa a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Puanin a tuam a, khualbûka an len ve tâk loh avângin ran chaw pêkna thlêngah a muttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu lai ramah chuan berâmputen berâm an vêng a, zânah an riah chilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa tirh vântirhkoh an hmaah a lo ding a, Lalpa ropuina chuan an vêl chu a chhun êng ta pup a; an hlau êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vântirhkoh erawh chuan an hnênah, “Hlau suh ula, ngai rawh u, mi tin tân Chanchin Ṭha lâwmawm êm êm ka rawn thlen che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vawiin hian in tân Davida khuaah Chhandamtu a piang ta, Lalpa Krista chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nausên, puana tuam, ran chaw pêkna thlênga mu in va hmuh chuan ani chu a ni tih hria ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thâwklehkhatan vântirhkoh kiangah chuan vân mipuiho an lo awm ta chiam a, Pathian an fak a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Chungnung berah khian Pathian chu ropui takin awm sela, Leiah hian a lawm êm êm mihringte zîngah rem lêng rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vântirhkohten vâna an kalsan tâk veleh berâmpute chuan, “Hawh u, Bethlehem-ah kal ila, Lalpa thu min hrilh lo thleng chu i va en ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, hmanhmawh takin an kal a, Mari te, Josefa te, ran chaw pêkna thlenga nausên mu te chu an va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An va hmuh chuan nausên chanchin vântirhkoh sawi kha an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hria apiang chuan berâmpute thu sawi chu mak an ti hle a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mari chuan chûng chu a vawng reng a, a ngaihtuah neuh neuh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vântirhkoh hrilh ang ngeia engkim an hmuha an hriat avâng chuan berâmpute chu Pathian chawimawi leh fak chung zêlin an kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ni riat a lo tlina a serh an tan ni chuan, a hmingah, chhûla a awm hma rênga vântirhkoh sak tawh sa Isua an sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mosia Dân anga an inthenna ni a lo thlen chuan nausên chu Lalpa hnêna hlân tûrin Jerusalem-ah an chhohpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa Dân thu-ah, “Fa tîr mipa tawh phawt chu Lalpa chanvo tûr a ni,” tih a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa Dân angin ṭhuro pahnih emaw, pârva no pahnih emaw inthawi nân an hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah chuan mi pakhat, a hming Sumeona a awm. Ani chu mi fel leh sakhaw mi tak a ni a, Israel thlamuantu tûr chu a thlîr reng a; a chungah Thlarau Thianghlim a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa Hriakthiha chu a hmuh hma chuan a thi lo vang tih Thlarau Thianghlimin a lo hrilh tawh rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thlarau hruaiin tempulah chuan a lo kal a, nausên Isua chu a nu leh pain Dânin a phût tihsak tûra an rawn hruai luh lai chuan a lo pawm a, Pathian a fak a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Aw Lalber, tûnah i thu ang ngeiin I bawih hi thlamuang takin i chhuahtîr dâwn ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />I chhandamna mi tin hmuha i siam kha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />ka mit hian a hmu ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jentail-te hnêna i êng tilang tûr leh I mi Israel-te ropuina tûr chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A nu leh pa chuan nausên chungchâng a sawi chu mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sumeona chuan anni chu mal a sâwm a, a nu Mari hnênah: “Ngai rawh, Israel zînga mi tam tak Tlûkchhiat nân leh din chhuah nân He nautê hi ruat a ni, Chhinchhiahna, an hnial luai luai tûra chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nang pawh, ngûnhnâma chhun angin i thin a la nâ ang, Mi tam tak rilru chhûngril tihlan a ni dâwn si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zâwlnei pakhat, Annii, Fanuela fanu, Asera hnam, tar tawh tak a awm bawk a. A pasal nên kum sarih an inneih hnuin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />kum sawmriat leh pali a hmeithai tawh a. Ani chuan Tempul kalsan lovin chaw te a nghei ṭhîn a, a chhûn a zân ṭawngṭaiin Pathian a be ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan ani chu a lo kal a, Pathian hnênah lâwmthu a sawi a, Jerusalem chhanchhuahna beiseitu apiang hnênah nausên chanchin chu a sawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lalpa Dân ang zêla thil an tih zawh vek hnu chuan Galili ramah, an khua Nazaret-ah chuan an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nausên pawh chu a ṭhang lian zêl a, a fing deuh deuh va, Pathian khawngaihna a chungah a awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A nu leh pate chu kum tin Jerusalem-ah Kalhlên Kût hmang tûrin an kal ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ani chu kum sâwm leh pahnih a nihin dân pangngai anga Kût hmang tûrin an chhohpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Kût an ṭiak a, an hâw ta a, naupang Isua erawh chu a nu leh pa te hriat lohvin Jerusalem-ah a châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />An pâwlte zîngah a awm a ni ang chu tiin ni khat an kal hman tawh a, an laichînte leh an hmêlhriatte zîngah an han zawn chuan an hmu ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Zawng zêl chungin Jerusalem-ah an kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ni thum ni chuan tempulah, zirtîrtuho bula a lo ṭhu ve chu an han hmu ta a; an thu a lo ngaithla a, thute a lo zâwt bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Anni chuan a finzia leh a chhân thiamzia an hriatin mak an ti hle hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A nu leh a pa chuan an han hmuh chuan mak an ti êm êm a, a nu chuan, “Mama, engati nge hetia min tih? I pa nên thlaphâng takin kan zawng kan zawng che asin le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Engah nge mi zawn? Ka Pa ina awm ngei tûr ka ni tih in hre lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />An hnêna a thu sawi chu a ngaihna an hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />An rual chuan a haw ve ta a, Nazaret an thleng a, an thu a awih êm êm zêl a; tin, a nu chuan chûng thu zawng zawng chu a rilruah a vawng reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu a lo ṭhang lian telh telh a, a fing deuh deuh va, Pathian khawngaihna leh mite duhsakna a dawng zêl a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tiberia Kaisara a lal kum sâwm leh panga kum chuan, Pontia Pilata chu Judai ram awptu a ni a, Heroda chu Galili ram lal a ni. A unau Filipa chu Ituria leh Trakonitis ram lal a ni a, Lusania chu Abilene ram lal a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anna leh Kaiafa chu Puithiam lalber an ni a; thlalêrah, Zakaria fapa Johana hnênah, Pathian thu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jordan lui ruam ram a fang vêl a, sual ngaihdam nân sima baptisma chan tûr thu a hril zêl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />zâwlnei Isaia lehkhabua, “Thlalêra mi au aw chuan Lalpa lamlian chei ula, A kal nân kawng tluang siam rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kawr tin chhûn khah vek a ni ang a, Tlâng tin mual tin râwt hniam a ni ang. A kawite chu a lo ngîl ang a, A bumbohte chu a lo rual bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian chhandamna chu mi tinin an hmu ang,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, mipui lo kalte hnênah chuan, “Rûl thlahte u, thinur lo thleng tûr pumpelh nân tu nge baptisma chang tûra fuih che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In sim ngei a ni tih tilang tûrin thil ti zâwk rawh u. ‘Kan pa chu Abrahama asin,’ in lo ti rilru mai dah ang e; ka hrilh a che u, Pathian chuan hêng lung hi Abrahama thlahah a din thei asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûn apangin hreipui chu thing bul tinah an dah ta; thing eng pawh rah ṭhaa rah lo chu kiha meia tuah mai tûr a ni,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipui chuan, “Chuti chu eng nge kan tih tûr le?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Tu pawh, kawr pahnih nei chuan a nei ve lo pe rawh se; chutiang bawkin ei nei chuan a nei ve lo pe rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chhiahkhawntute pawh baptisma chang tûrin an lo kal a, “Zirtîrtu, eng nge kan tih tûr?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan “Chhiah bi tûr aia tam phût suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sipaite pawh chuan, “Anih, keini hi, eng nge kan tih ve tûr?” an ti a. Ani chuan “Tihluihnain emaw, dâwtin emaw tu ma thil lâksak suh ula, in hlawhah lungawi rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mite beisei chu a sâng hle a, Johana chu ‘Krista a ni mai âwm e,’ tia an ngaihtuah rilrûk lai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Johana chuan an za-in a hrilh a, “Kei zawngin tuiin ka baptis che u a; nimahsela, kei aia ropui zâwk a lo kal dâwn a, kei hi chu a pheikhawk hrui phelh tlâk pawh ka ni lo. Ani zawngin Thlarau Thianghlim leh meiin a baptis ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hruiha buh zâp faia zêma khung mai tûrin a sisêp chu a keng tawh a, a site erawh chu tihmih rual loh meiah a hâl ral ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutiang chuan fuihna thu dang tam tak nên mite hnênah Chanchin Ṭha chu a hril ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal Heroda pawh kha, a nau nupui Herodi nêna an chungchâng thu-ah leh thil sual dang a tih zawng zawng chungthu-ah a zilhhau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Heroda chuan ama thil sual tih tâk zawng zawng belhchhahin Johana chu tân inah a khung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawngin baptisma an chang a. Isua pawhin a chang ve a, a ṭawngṭai laiin vân a lo inhawng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thlarau Thianghlim chu taksa neiin ṭhuro angin a chungah a lo chhuk a, “Nang, ka Fapa, ka Duhtaka chu i ni, i chungah ka lâwm êm êm e,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rawng a bâwl ṭan chuan Isua chu kum sawmthum laia upa a ni tawh a, mi ngaih chuan Josefa fapa a ni. Chu mi chu Helia fa a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ani chu Matthata fa a ni; ani chu Levia fa a ni; ani chu Melkia fa a ni; ani chu Jannaia fa a ni; ani chu Josefa fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ani chu Mattathia fa a ni; ani chu Amosa fa a ni; ani chu Nahuma fa a ni; ani chu Eslia fa a ni; ani chu Naggaia fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ani chu Maatha fa a ni; ani chu Mattathia fa a ni; ani chu Semeia fa a ni; ani chu Joseka fa a ni; ani chu Joda fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ani chu Joana fa a ni; ani chu Resa fa a ni; ani chu Zerubabela fa a ni; ani chu Salathiela fa a ni; ani chu Neria fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ani chu Melkia fa a ni; ani chu Addia fa a ni; ani chu Kosama fa a ni; ani chu Elmadama fa a ni; ani chu Era fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ani chu Isua fa a ni; ani chu Eliezara fa a ni; ani chu Jorima fa a ni; ani chu Matthata fa a ni; ani chu Levia fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />ani chu Simeona fa a ni; ani chu Juda fa a ni; ani chu Josefa fa a ni; ani chu Jonama fa a ni; ani chu Eliakima fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />ani chu Melea fa a ni; ani chu Menna fa a ni; ani chu Mattatha fa a ni; ani chu Nathana fa a ni; ani chu Davida fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />ani chu Jesaia fa a ni; ani chu Obeda fa a ni; ani chu Boaza fa a ni; ani chu Sala fa a ni; ani chu Nasona fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />ani chu Aminadaba fa a ni; ani chu Admina fa a ni; ani chu Arnia fa a ni; ani chu Esroma fa a ni; ani chu Faresa fa a ni; ani chu Juda fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />ani chu Jakoba fa a ni; ani chu Isaka fa a ni; ani chu Abrahama fa a ni; ani chu Tera fa a ni; ani chu Nahora fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />ani chu Seruga fa a ni; ani chu Hragaia fa a ni; ani chu Falega fa a ni; ani chu Ebera fa a ni; ani chu Sala fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />ani chu Kainana fa a ni; ani chu Arfaksada fa a ni; ani chu Sema fa a ni; ani chu Nova fa a ni; ani chu Lameka fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />ani chu Methusela fa a ni; ani chu Enoka fa a ni; ani chu Jareda fa a ni; ani chu Mahalaleela fa a ni; ani chu Kainana fa a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />ani chu Enosa fa a ni; ani chu Setha fa a ni; ani chu Adama fa a ni; ani chu Pathian fa a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isua chu Thlarau Thianghlimin a khat a, Jordan lui aṭanga a lo haw chu, Diabola thlêm chungin thlalêrah ni sawmli Thlarau hruaiin a thang bo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chûng chhûng chuan eng mah a ei lo va, a tâwpah chuan a ril a ṭâm ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Diabolan a hnênah, “Pathian Fapa i nih tak tak chuan he lung hi chhanga chang tûrin thu pe rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “ ‘Chhang ringawt ringin mihring hi an nung tûr a ni lo, tih ziak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmun sâng takah a hruai chho va, mitkhapkâr lovah khawvêl ram zawng zawng a entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Diabola chuan, “Hêng zawng zawng chunga thuneihna leh a ropuina hi ka pe ang che; ka hnêna pêk a ni tawh a, ka duh duh pe thei pawh ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang hi chuan chibai mi bûk la, a za-in i ta a ni vek mai tûr,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isuan, “ ‘Lalpa i Pathian chu chibai bûk la, ama rawng chauh bâwl rawh,’ tih ziak a ni,” a tihsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah a hruai leh a, Tempul chhîpah a dah a, “Pathian Fapa i nih meuh chuan heta ṭang hian zuang thla rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Nangmah vêng tûr chein Vântirhkohte chu thu a pe ang,’ tih leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘An kutin an dâwm ang chia, Tichuan, lungah i ke i sawh dâwn lo nia,’ tih ziak ang khân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “ ‘Lalpa i Pathian fiah suh,’ tih ziak a ni,” a tihsan leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Diabolan a thlêmna tûr tinrênga a thlêm zawh chuan a remchân leh hun atân a kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Thlarau thiltihtheihna nên Galili ramah a haw ta a; chu mi bial pumah chuan a chanchin a thang vêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An sunagog-ahte mi a zirtîr ṭhîn a, miten an hlut hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A seilenna khua Nazaret chu a lo thleng a, a tih dân pângngaiin Sabat ni chuan sunagog-ah a lût a, chhiar tûrin a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zâwlnei Isaia lehkhabu zial chu an pe a, he thu chuanna thleng hian a han phelh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa Thlarau chu ka chungah a awm a, Pachhiate hnêna Chanchin Ṭha hril tûrin Hriak mi thih a ni. Saltâng chhuah tûr thu te, Mitdel mit vâr tûr thu te, Rahbeh chhan chhuah tûr thu te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa duhsakna lan hun thleng ta te hi Puang tûrin mi tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lehkhabu chu a zial a, rawngbâwltu a pe leh a, a ṭhu ta a, sunagog-a mi zawng zawng chuan an en ṭhuap mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An hnênah, “He lehkha Thu hi vawiin hian in hriatah a lo thleng ta,” tiin a han sawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An za chuan sawi ṭha an ti hle a, a thu sawi duhawm tak chu mak an ti a, “He mi hi Josefa fapa kha a ni lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “‘Daktor, nangmah intidam rawh,’ an tih ṭhin ang hian nangni pawhin, ‘Kapernaum khuaa i thil tih kan hriat angte kha i khaw lamah pawh hian ti ve ta che,’ min la tih dâwn ngei hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A sawi zêl a, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, zâwlnei tu mah ama khaw lama miten an lâwm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Dik tak chuan, Elija pawh kha, a dam laia kum thum leh thla ruk khua a khena, khawvêla ṭâm nasa tak tlâk lai khân, Israel ramah hmeithai tam tak an awm na a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />an zînga tu hnênah mah tirh a ni lo va. Sidon rama Zarefat khaw hmeithai pakhat hnênah chauh tirh a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zâwlnei Elisa dam lai pawh khân Israel ramah phâr tam tak an awm na a, an zîngah, Suria mi Naamana chauh lo chu tu mah dang tihthianghlim an nih loh kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng thu chu an hriatin sunagog-a awm zawng zawng chu an thinur ta êm êm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />an thawk lawk a, khua ata chu an nam chhuak a, an khaw kiang khâma nam thlâk tûrin an hruai ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />nimahsela, ani chuan mipui a tâwn tlang a, a kal ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Galili rama khaw pakhat Kapernaum-ah a zuk kal a. Sabat ni chuan mite chu a zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thunei taka a zirtîr avâng chuan a zirtîrna chu mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sunagog-ah chuan ramhuai bawlhhlawh thlarau pai a awm a, ring takin a au ta chiam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“E! Nazaret Isu, kan chungthu-ah rawn inrawlh i tum elo? Min tiboral tûrin i lo kal em ni? Tu nge i nih ka hria, Pathian Mi Thianghlim chu i ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Isua chuan a hau va, “Ngawi la, a chhûng ata lo chhuak rawh,” a ti a. Ramhuai chuan leiah a tithlu a, amah tina lovin a chhuahsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />An za chuan mak an ti a, “Hei hi eng thu nge ni ta ngai? Thuneihna leh thiltihtheihna hmangin thlarau bawlhhlawhte thu a pe a, an chhuah tâk mai hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi bial hmun tinah a chanchin chu a thang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, a tho va, sunagog aṭang chuan Simona inah a lût a. Simona pizawn chu a khua a lo sik hluah mai a, a tân an lo ngensak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A kiangah a va ding a, khawsik chu a hau va, a reh ta a; tichuan, a tho thei ta nghâl a, chaw ei a siamsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ni tlâk lai vêl chuan natna hrang hranga na, damlo nei apiang chuan an rawn hruai a; an zaa chungah kut a lo nghat ṭheuh va, a tidam zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ramhuaite pawh, “Pathian Fapa i ni,” tia auvin mi tam tak kawchhûng ata an lo chhuak bawk a; anni chu Isuan a hau va. Krista a ni tih an hriat avângin an ṭawng a phal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A tûk zîngah chuan hmun fianrialah a kal a, mipuite chuan an zawng a, a hnênah an lo kal a, anmahni a kalsan loh nân chelh an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan, “Khaw dangahte pawh Pathian ram Chanchin Ṭha hi hril tûr ka ni asin; chumi avânga tirh ka ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tichuan, Judai rama sunagog-ahte chuan a lût a, thu a hril vêl ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat chu Pathian thu ngaithla tûra mipuiin an bâwr huai huai lai chuan Genesaret dîl kamah a ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />dîl kama lawng pahnih awm chu a hmu a, sangha mantute chu an chhuak a, an lênte an sûksan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lawng pakhat, Simona ta zâwkah chuan a chuang a; a hnênah vaukam ata dîla tlêma tawlh luh deuh a dîl a. Lawnga ṭhu chung chuan mipui chu a zirtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thu sawi zawhah chuan, Simona hnênah, “Li thûk lam pan la sangha man tûrin in lênte dêng rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simona chuan, “Hotupa, tlaivâr zakin kan dêng tawh a, eng mah kan man lo asin; nimahsela, i thuin lênte chu ka han dêng ang e,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A han den chuan sangha an khuh ta ṭeuh mai a, an lênte pawh chu a ṭet dâwn ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, lawng danga an pâwlpui awmte chu anmahni pui tûrin an hui a. Anni chu an lo kal a, lawng pahnih chu pil lek lek khawpin an chhûng khat ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu chu Simon Petera chuan a hmuhin Isua ke bulah chuan a kûn a, “Lalpa, min kalsan rawh, mi sual ka nih hi,” a ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />an sangha man chu ani leh a ṭhiante chuan mak an ti êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simona pâwla mi, Zebedaia fapa Jakoba leh Johana te pawh chuan mak an ti êm êm a. Isuan Simona hnênah, “Hlau suh, tûna chinah zawng mihring i man tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An lawngte chu vaukamah an kar kai a, engkim kalsanin amah chu an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vawi khat chu khaw pakhata a awm laiin pa pakhat, a taksa puma phâr hian Isua chu a hmu a, bawkkhupin tihdam a dîl a, “Lalpa, i duh chuan mi tithianghlim thei e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan a han ban a, a dek a, “Ka duh e, lo thianghlim tawh ang che,” a ti a. A phâr chu a lo dam ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hnênah chuan, “Tu mah hrilh suh; amaherawhchu, puithiam va inentîr la, i dam ngei tih miten an hriat theih nân Mosia thupêk angin i inthen nân thil hlân rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, a chanchin chu a thang zual ta sauh va; mipui tam tak a thu hriat duh leh an nâte tihdamsak duhin an lo kal khâwm tup tup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani erawh chu fianrialah a ṭawngṭai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan ni khat chu mite a zirtîr a. An zîngah chuan Galili leh Judai ram khaw tin aṭang leh Jerusalem aṭangtea lo kal khâwm Farisai-te leh Dân zirtîrtute chu an awm ve a; tin, mi tihdam nân Lalpa thiltihtheihnain amahah chuan a thawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan tlangvâlhovin zeng pakhat, a mutna chawpin an rawn zâwn a; zâwn luha a hmaa dah an tum a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />nimahsela, mipui avâng chuan zâwn luh ngaihna a awm lo va; in chungah an lâwn a, in chung chu an phawk a, chuta ṭang chuan a mutna nên a laia Isua hma takah chuan hruiin an thlâk thla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An rinzia chu a hmuhin a hnênah, “Ṭhiana, i sualte ngaihdam a ni ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dân zirtîrtute leh Farisai-te chuan, “Pathian pawisawi hi tu nge maw a nih le? Pathian chauh lo chuan tu nge sual ngaidam thei?” an inti hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, Isuan an thu sawi chu a hriatin an hnênah, “Engati nge rilrua chutianga in ngaihtuah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘I sualte ngaihdam a ni ta,’ tih nge awl a, ‘Tho la, kêin kal tawh rawh,’ tih hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khawvêlah hian Mihring Fapa hian sual a ngaidam thei tih ka han hriattîr ang che u,” a ti a; zeng hnênah chuan, “Tho la, i mutna kha la la, i inah haw rawh ka ti a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An mit hmuhah chuan a tho ta mai a, a mutna chu a la a, Pathian fak chung zêlin a in lamah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An za chuan mak an ti êm êm a, Pathian an fak a, “Vawiin chu thil mak dang lam tak kan hmu alâwm,” an ti a, an hlau hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chumi zawh chuan a chhuak a, chhiah khawnna hmuna ṭhu, chhiahkhawntu pakhat, a hming Levia chu Isuan a hmu a, “Mi zui rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ani chu a tho va, engkim kalsanin a zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Levia chuan a inah ruai ropui tak a ṭhehsak a; tichuan, chhiahkhawntute leh mi dang tam takin chawhlui chu an rawn kîlpui hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Farisai-te chu Dân zirtîrtute nên chuan a zirtîrte chungah an lo phunnawi a, “Engah nge chhiahkhawntute leh mi sualte nêna in eia in inho le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Isua chuan a chhang a, “Mi hrisêlten daktor an ngai lo va, mi bawrhsâwmten an ngai zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi felte lam tûr ni lovin, an sim theih nân mi sualte lam tûra lo kal ka ni zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “Johana zirtîrten chaw nghei an chîng hle a, an ṭawngṭai chhên bawk a; chutiang bawkin Farisai zirtîrte pawhin an chîng a, i hote lah hian an eiin an in zêl mai si,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “An zînga moneitu a awm chhûng chuan mo hruaitute chu chaw in ngheitîr ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Moneitu chu an hnên ata hruai bo hun a lo la awm ang; chûng hunah erawh chuan an la nghei ve ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />An hnênah chuan tehkhin thu pawh a sawi a, “Tu man puan thar pawt thlain puan hluiah an bel ngai lo, bel teh rêng pawh ni se, a thar chu an tithlêr chhe mai mai a, a thar them lahin a hlui chu a rem bawk hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Uain thar pawh tu man savun ip hluiah an thun ngai hek lo, thun se, uain thar chuan savun ip chu a tâwn keh ang a, a baw ral ang a, savun ip pawh chu a chhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Uain thar chu savun ip tharahte thun zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, an in ṭhan uain an in hnuin a thar an duh ngai lo, ‘a hlui nge nge a ni tui,’ an ti ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sabat vawi khat pawh buhpui hmunahte a kal tlang a; a zirtîrte chuan a vui an thliak a, an kutin an nuai fai a, an bâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Farisai tute emaw chuan, “Engati nge Sabat nia tih thiang lo chu in tih ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isuan anni chu a chhâng a, “A ṭhiante nên an rilṭâm laia Davida thil tih kha in chhiar lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian inah a lût a, puithiamte chauh ei thian chhangdah chu a la a, a ei a, a ṭhiante pawh a pêk ve thu kha?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hnênah, “Mihring Fapa hi Sabat ni Lalpa a ni,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sabat ni dang lehah chuan sunagog-ah a lût a, a zirtîr a. Chutah chuan mi pakhat kut ding lam zeng a awm ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dân zirtîrtute leh Farisai-te chuan a hêkna tûr an hmuh theih nân Sabat nia a tihdam dâwn leh dâwn loh an lo châng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An rilru chu a hriatin kut zeng hnênah chuan, “Tho la, a laiah hian ding chhuak teh,” a ti a. Ani chu a tho va, a laiah chuan a ding chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Sabat niah tihṭhat nge thiang tihchhiat, mi chhandam nge thiang tihhlum - ka zâwt a che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, an za chuan a han en vêl a, zeng hnênah chuan, “I kut phar rawh,” a ti a. A han phar a, a kut chu a lo dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anniho chu thin tâwtin an puakkeh lek lek a, Isua chu engtia tih tûr nge tih an inrâwn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutih lai vêl chuan zan khat chu tlângah ṭawngṭai tûrin a kal a. Pathian hnênah a ṭawngṭai zânkhua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khua a lo vâr chuan a zirtîrte chu a ko va, an zîng ata sâwm leh pahnih a thlang a, an hmingah tirhkoh a vuah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Simona, Petera a vuah te, a unau Andria te, Jakoba leh Johana te, Filipa leh Bartholomaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mathaia leh Thoma te, Alfaia fapa Jakoba te, Simona, Zealota an vuah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jakoba fapa Juda te, a mantîrtu ni ta Juda Iskariota teho chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An rual chuan a chhuk a, phaizâwlah a ding a. Chutah chuan a zirtîrte tam tak leh Judai ram zawng zawng ata te, Jerusalem ata te, Tura leh Sidon vêl tuifinriat kam ata te mipui nasa tak, a thu ngaihthlâk duh leh an nâte tihdam beiseia lo kalte chu an awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />thlarau bawlhhlawh sawisakte pawh an lo dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mipui zawng zawng chuan amah deh an tum a, a hnên ata thiltihtheihna a chhuak a, mi tin a tidam zêl si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a hawi vêl a, a zirtîrte chu a en a: Pachhiate u, in chan a ṭha e, Pathian ram in ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tûna rilṭâmte u, in chan a ṭha e, in la tlai dâwn si a, Tûna ṭapte u, in chan a ṭha e, in la nui dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihring Fapa avânga miten an huat che u a, an ensan che u a, an hau che ua, hmingchhe taka an hnâwl hunah che u chuan in chan a va ṭha dâwn êm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan lâwm ula, hlimin zuang ang che u, ngai teh u, vânah in lâwmman a awm hnêm si a; in chunga an tih ang bawkin an thlahtute pawhin zâwlneite chungah an tih ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nangni hausate u, in chung a pik e, nuam in chên zo dêr tawh si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tûna tlai puarte u, in chung a pik e, in ril a la ṭâm dâwn si a; Tûna nuite u, in chung a pik e, lusûna lungngaiin in la ṭap dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mi zawng zawngin an fak hle che u chuan in va khawngaihthlâk dâwn êm; chutiang bawkin an thlahtuten zâwlnei derte an fak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ka thu ngaithlatute u, nangni zawng ka ti a che u, in hmêlmate chu hmangaih ula, a hawtu che u chungah chuan ṭhat chhuah ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ânchhe lawhtu che u chu malsâwmna dîlsak ula, a tiduhdahtu che u chu ṭawngṭaisak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“I biang lehlam bêngtu hnênah a lehlam pawh dawh rawh. I puan lâksaktu che chuan i kawr a lâk pawh hnial suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A dîltu apiang che chu pe la, i sum lâksaktu che chu dîl leh tawh suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />In chungah miin ti se in tih ang ngeiin mi chungah pawh ti ve rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Nangmahni hmangaihtu chauh in hmangaihin eng nge mi sualte aia in danglam bîkna? Anni pawhin anmahni hmangaihtute chu an hmangaih ṭhîn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />In chunga ṭhate lakah chauh ṭhat in chhuah hian eng nge mi sualte aia in danglam bîkna? Anni pawhin chutiang bawkin an ti ṭhîn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hmuh kîr leh beisei theihna hnên chauhva thil in pûktîr hian eng nge mi sualte aia in danglam bîkna? Anni pawhin a ngai hmu kîr leh tûr chuan mi sualte hnênah an pûktîr ṭhîn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />In hmêlmate chu hmangaih zâwk rawh u, an chungah thil ṭha ti ula, hmuh kîr leh beisei kher lovin pûktîr rawh u; tichuan, lâwmman tam tak in hmu ang a, Chungnungbera fate in ni dâwn nia; Ani zawngin lâwm nachâng hre lote leh mi sualte pawh a khawngaih vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />In Pain mi a khawngaih ṭhîn ang bawkin nangni pawhin mi khawngaih ṭhîn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Mi sawisêl suh u; tichuan, sawisêl in ni lo vang; tu mah thiamlovah ruat mai hek suh u; tichuan, thiam loh in ni lo vang; ngaidam rawh u; tichuan, ngaihdam in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pe rawh u; tichuan, pêk in ni ang; ṭhahnemngai taka teh chhuaka, beng mukin, sâwi liam zawih zawih khawpin in ângchhûngah pêk in ni ang. Tehna in hman ngei khân tehsak in ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah tehkhin thu a sawi a, “Mitdelin mitdel vêk a hruai thei dâwn êm ni? Khuarkhurumah an tla dûn mai lâwng maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Zirlai chu an zirtîrtu chungah an awm lo, an zir zawhah erawh chuan an zirtîrtu an tluk tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Engtizia nge mahni mita thingtum awm chu hre si lovin i unau mita thil tê tak tê awm chu i hmuh ni? Mahni mita thingtum awm chu ngaimawh si lovin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />i unau hnênah, ‘Unau, i mita thil tê tak tê kha mi lâk chhuahtîr rawh,’ engtin nge i tih theih le? Mi vervêk, i mita thingtum awm kha la chhuak hmasa zet rawh; chutichuan, i unau mit ata thil tê tak tê lâk chhuah tûr awm chu fiah takin i hmu thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Thing ṭha a rah chhe ngai lo, thing chhia lah a rah ṭha ngai hek lo. Thing chu a rah aṭangin eng ang nge a nih a hriat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tu man hlîng bukah theipui an lo ngai lo, hnimhlîngnei kûngah pawh grep rah an lo ngai bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mi ṭha chuan a thinlung robâwm ṭha ata thil ṭhate a phawrh chhuak ṭhîn, mi sual erawh chuan a thinlung robâwm ṭha lo ata thil ṭha lote a phawrh chhuak ṭhîn; thinlunga liam khawpa khat hi a ni kâin in sawi chhuah ṭhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“‘Lalpa, Lalpa’ mi ti siin engati nge ka thu in zawm loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tu pawh ka hnêna lo kala, ka thu hriaa, zâwmtu chu tu ang nge a nih ka hrilh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />In satu, thûk taka lei laia, lungpui chunga lungphûm remtu ang chu a ni: in chu tuilianin rawn hrût mah se, a tinghîng thei lo, a sak ngun êm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ka thu hriaa zâwm lo chu lungphûm nei lova lei chung maia in satu ang chu a ni; in chu tuilianin a rawn hrût a, a chhe ta nghâl a, a tlu sawp rem rum mai a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mite hriat atâna a duh ang a sawi zawh chuan Kapernaumah a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sipai za hotu pakhat bawih duh tak a dam lo va, a thi lek lek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isua chanchin a lo hriat chuan a bawih tidam tûra ngên tûrin Juda upate a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni chuan Isua hnên an va thleng a, ṭhahnemngai takin an ngên a, “Hei hi i tihsak tlâk a ni e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kan hnam hi a hmangaih a, sunagog pawh min saksak a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua chu an rualin a kal ve ta a. In a thlen dâwn chuan sipai za hotu chuan a ṭhiante a tîr a, “Lalpa, lo kal harsa duh suh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ka in chhûng i luhna tlâk a ni lo va, i hnêna lo kal tlâkah pawh ka inngai lo va ni; thu pe la, ka nau chu a dam mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei pawh mi thuhnuaia awm ka ni a, ka hnuaiah sipaite an awm leh chhâwng a, ‘Kal rawh,’ ka tiha chu a kal a, ‘lo haw rawh,’ ka tiha chu a lo haw mai a, ka bawih pawhin ‘hei hi ti rawh,’ ka tih chu a ti mai ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Isuan chu chu a hriatin chu mi chu mak a ti hle a, a lehhawi a, a zuitu mipui hnênah, “Ka hrilh a che u, heti êma ring nasa hi Israel-te zîngah tu mah ka hmu lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tirhte kha inah an va haw leh chuan bawih chu damin an va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hnu lawkah khaw pakhat Nain an tihah chuan a kal a, a zirtîrte leh mipui nasa tak an kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khaw kulh kawngka a thlen dâwn chuan, ngai teh, mitthi an rawn zâwn chhuak a; a nu chu hmeithai a ni a, a fapa mal a ni. Khuaa mi tam tak pawh an lo kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a han hmuhin chu nu chu a khawngaih ta êm êm a, “Ṭap tawh suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A va hnaih a, hlâng chu a chelh a, a zâwntute pawh chu an ding ta a; “Tlangvâl, tho rawh, ka ti a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mitthi chu a ṭhuchhuak a, a lo ṭawng ta a, a nu hnênah chuan a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi zawng zawngin an hlau ta a, Pathian an fak a, “Kan zîngah zâwlnei ropui tak a lo awm ta a nih hi,” an ti a; “Pathianin a mite a rawn tlawh ta a nih hi,” an ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng thu chu Judai ram zawng zawngah leh a kiang vêl ram tinah a thang chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng thu zawng zawng chu Johana zirtîrte chuan an pu chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Johana chuan a zirtîr pahnih a ko va, Lalpa hnênah chuan a tîr a, “Lo kal tûra chu i ni nge, mi dang kan la nghâk ang?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chu mite chu Isua hnên an va thleng a, “Baptistu Johanan, ‘Lo kal tûra i ni nge mi dang kan la nghâk ang?’ tiin i hnênah min tîr a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutih lai tak chuan Isuan mi tam tak, natna tuar te, hripui vei te, thlarau bawlhhlawh paite a tidam a, mitdel tam tak pawh an mit a lo tihvârsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, anni chu a chhâng a, “Kal leh ta ula, in thil hmuh leh in hriatte hi Johana chu va hrilh tawh u; mitdelte chu an mit a vâr a, kebaite kein an kal a, phârte an thianghlim a, bengngawngte pawh an beng a vâr a, mitthite kaihthawh an ni ta a, pachhiate hnênah Chanchin Ṭha hrilh a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu pawh ka laka beidawng lo chu an nihlawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Johana mi tirhte an haw hnu chuan mipui hnênah Johana chungchâng a sawi ta a. “Eng ennawm en tûrin nge thlalêrah in kal? Thli chhêm nghîn luang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A nih leh tu en tûrin nge in kal? Puan nêm sina inchei maw? Puan nêm sin leh mi neinungte chu lal inah asin an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Eng ber en tûrin nge in kal? Zâwlnei en tûrin maw? A nih ngei kha; ka hrilh a che u, ani chu zâwlnei ai pawha ropui zâwk a ni. He mi hi alâwm:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘Ngai teh, ka tirhkoh i hmaah ka tîr a, Ani chuan i hmaah i kawng a buatsaih ang,’ tia a chanchin an ziak kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, hmeichhe hrin zîngah Johana aia ropui zâwk an awm lo; amaherawhchu, Pathian rama mi tê ber pawh ani ai chuan a ropui zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Vântlângho leh chhiahkhawntute chuan Johana thu an hriatin Pathian thiltih dik tak chu pawmin a baptisma an chang hlawm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Farisai-te leh Dân hremite erawh chuan baptisma chu an chang ve duh lo, anmahni tâna Pathian remruat chu an duh lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Isuan, “Tûnlai mite hi eng nên nge ka tehkhin ang? Eng ang nge an nih? Naupang dâwrpui hmuna ṭhu-a, inau tawna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />‘Phênglâwng kan tumsak che u a, in lâm lo va, kan ṭap vak a, in ṭap chuang bawk si lo,’ intite ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Baptistu Johana chu a lo kal a, chhang a ei lo va, uain a in hek lo va, nangnin ‘ramhuai a zâwl a nih hi,’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mihring Fapa a lo kal a, a eiin a in a, nangnin, ‘En teh u, mi vir, uain heh mi, chhiahkhawntute leh mi sualte ṭhian saw,’ in ti leh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian finna dikzia chu a pawmtuteah a lang chhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Farisai zînga pakhatin chaw eiah a sâwm a, Farisai inah chuan a lût a, chaw a kîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ngai teh, chumi khuaa hmeichhe sual pakhatin Farisai inah chaw a ei tih a hriat chuan alabasta bûrin hriak rimtui a rawn keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A hnungah, a ke bulah chuan ṭap chungin a ding a; a mittui chuan a ke chu a far huh a, a sam chuan a zu hru a, a ke chu a fâwp ta ngawih ngawih a, hriak rimtui chu a leih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A sâwmtu Farisai chuan a hmuhin, “He mi hi zâwlnei ni tak tak se chu a dektu hmeichhia hi tu nge a niha, eng ang mi sual nge a nih hi a hre tûr,” a ti rilru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Simon, i hnênah thu kam khat sawi tûr ka nei,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Sawi ta che, Zirtîrtu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Isuan, “Mi pahnihin tangka pûktîrtu hnênah lei an ba a, pakhat chuan duli zanga, pakhat chuan duli sawmnga. Rulhna an neih loh avângin a ngaidam ve ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chutichuan, tu zâwk chuan nge ani chu hmangaih zâwk ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Simona chuan, “A ngaihdam tam zâwk chuan a ni ang chu,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “I ti dik e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hmeichhe lam chu a hawi a, Simona hnênah, “He hmeichhia hi i hmu êm? I inah ka lo lût a, nangin ka ke silna tûr tui mi pe lo va, ani hi chuan a mittuiin ka ke a tihuh a, a samin a hru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nangin mi lo fâwp lo va, ani hi chuan a lo luh tirh ata ka ke fawh a bâng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nangin ka luah hriak mi thih lo va, ani erawh hi chuan hriak rimtui a leih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka hrilh a che, a sual zawng zawng chu ngaihdam a ni ta, ani pawhin heti tak hian a hmangaih a ni. Ngaihdamsak nêp chuan a hmangaih nêp ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “I sualte ngaihdam a ni ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A chaw kîlpuite chuan, “Sualte pawh ngaidam ta mai chu tu nge maw a nih le?” an inti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, anin hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “I rinna hian a chhandam che a ni, thlamuang takin kal rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng hnu lawkah chuan khaw lian leh khaw tête fangin Pathian ram Chanchin Ṭha chu hrilin a puang zêl a; Sâwmpahnihte pawh an tel ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nu ṭhenkhat, thlarau bawlhhlawh pai tihdamte leh na dam lehte pawh an tel bawk; Magdala khaw mi, a kawchhûng ata ramhuai pasarih chhuak ta Mari an tih te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Heroda sum enkawltu Chuza nupui Joani te, Susani te leh mi dang tam takte chu; chûngte chuan anmahni neihin Isua leh a hote rawng an bâwlsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, mipui nasa tak an lo pung khâwm a, khaw tin ata miin an rawn pan huai huai a; tehkhin thu hmangin thu a lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Buh chi thehtu chu buh chi thehin a feh a; chutia a han theh chuan a ṭhen kawngah a tla a, miten an rap mai mai a, chunglêng savaten an tlân zo ta thuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ṭhen pialtlêp chungah a tla a, ṭo chu a han ṭo thuai a; mahse, a hnâwn loh avângin a râwp ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ṭhen hnimhlîngnei zîngah a tla a, hnim chuan a ṭhan khalh a, a dîp ral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ṭhen lei ṭhaah a tla a, a lo ṭhang lian a, a lêt za-in a rah ta a,” a ti a. Chûng thu chu a sawi a, “Ngaihthlâkna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se,” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zirtîrte chuan chu tehkhin thu chu eng tihna nge tih an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Pathian ram thu ril chu nangni hriat atâna tih a ni a, mi dangte tân erawh chuan thu harsa a ni; hmu reng mah se an hmuh fiah theih lohva, hre mah se an hriatthiam loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tehkhin thu awmzia chu hei hi a ni: Buh chi chu Pathian thu hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kawnga mi chu thu ngaithlatute an ni, an awih lohva chhandam an nih loh nân Diabola a lo kal a, an thinlunga thu chu a lâk zawhsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pialtlêp chunga mi chu, an hriat veleh thu chu lâwm taka pawm tate hi an ni; nimahsela, zung rêng an kai lo va, rei lo tê zawng an awih mai a, thlêmna an han tâwk hlek a, an tlûksan leh mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hnimhlîngnei zînga tlate chu thu chu an hria a, a han ṭhang ve a; mahse, dam chhûng khawsak engtona leh nawmsak duhna chuan a rawn dîp a, rah puitling a chhuah ve ta lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lei ṭhaa mi chu hêngte hi an ni, thu chu hriaa, rilru dik leh ṭha pua, vawng tlata, bei hrâm hrâma rah chhuah tate hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tu man an khâwnvâr hâl chu bêlin an khuh ngai lo, khum hnuaiah pawh an dah ngai hek lo, a lût apiangin a êng an hmuh theih nân a dahnaah an dah zâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eng mah puan leh loh tûra zêp a awm lo, hriat loh tûr leh tihlan loh tûrin eng mah thuhrûk a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, in thu dawnsawn dânah fîmkhur rawh u, a nei apiang chu an pêk belhchhah ang a, a nei lo chu neia a inhriat chhun pawh an lâksak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A nu leh a unaute pawh a hnênah an lo kal a; nimahsela, mipui avângin an pawh thei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“I nu leh i unauten hmuh tum chein pâwnah sâwn an nghâk a che,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Pathian thu hriaa zâwmte hi ka nu leh ka unaute an ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni khat chu a zirtîrte nên lawngah an chuang a, an hnênah, “Dîl râl lehlamah sâwn i kai ang u,” a ti a, an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutia an kal lai chuan a lo muhîl a, dîlah chuan thlipui a lo tleh chhuk phut a, an lawng chu tuiin a khat dâwn ta mai a, an ngaihtuahawm ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A hnênah an kal a, an kai tho va, “Hotupa, hotupa, kan boral dâwn e,” an ti a. Ani chu a lo tho va, thli leh tuifâwn chu a hau va; a bâng a, a reh ta ṭhuap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Khawiah nge in rinna?” a ti a. An hlau va, mak an ti êm êm a, “He mi hi tu nge ni le? Thli leh tui lam pawh thu a pe a, an awih mai hi!” an inti hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Galili ram zâwn Gerasin mite ramah chuan an va kai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khawmuala a chhuah chuan khuaa mi, ramhuai man pakhat hian a rawn pan a. Chu mi chu rei tawh tak puan sin lovin inah pawh awm lovin thlânahte a chêng ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isua a han hmuh chuan a au va, a hmaah a bawkkhup a, ring takin “Isu, Pathian chungnungbera Fapa, ka chungthu-ah rawn inrawlh i tum elo? Mi nghaisa lul lo tûrin ka ngên a che,” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chu mi kawchhûnga thlarau bawlhhlawh chu chhuak tûrin thu a lo pe tawh si a. Ramhuai chuan vawi tam tak a buan tawh ṭhîn a, khaidiat te, kawlte an buntîr a, an vêng ṭhîn a; nimahsela, an hlinnate chu a tichat a, ramhuai chuan thlalêrahte a hruai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Tu nge i hming?” a ti a. Ani chuan “Sângruka” a ti a, a chhûnga ramhuai lût chu an tam êm vâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Leilâwta paih thla lo tûrin amah an ngên chûl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chumi tlângah chuan vawk rual, tam tak an tla a, an kawchhûnga luh phal tûrin a hnênah an ngên a; ani chuan a phalsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ramhuaite chuan chu mi chu an chhuahsan a, vawk kawchhûngah chuan an lût a, vawk rual chu khâm kovah chuan an tlân liam a, tuiah an tla hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A enkawltute chuan thil lo thleng chu an hmuhin an tlânchhia a, khuaa mite leh a chhehvêla mite chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, eng thil nge lo thleng ta tih en tûrin mite chu an thawk chhuak a, Isua hnên an lo thlen chuan ramhuai chhuahsan tâka kha puan sina, rilru ngai puin Isua ke bula a ṭhu chu an rawn hmu a, hlauhawm an ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chûng thil hmutute chuan ramhuai man lo dam tâk dân chu an lo hrilh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Gerasin rama mi zawng zawng chuan hlauhawm an tih êm avâng chuan an hnên ata chhuak tûrin an ngên a; tichuan, ani chu lawngah a chuang a, kîr leh a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ramhuai chhuahsana khân a hnêna tel ve zêl a ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan, “I in lamah haw la, Pathianin thil a tihsak che hi va hril zâwk tawh,” tiin a kirtîr ta a. Tichuan, a kal a, khawpui chhûng zawng zawngah chuan Isuan thil a tihsak chu a va tlângaupui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Isua lo kîr leh chu mipuite chuan an lo nghâk ṭuai a, an lo lâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ngai teh, mi pakhat, a hming Jaira, sunagog hotu chu a lo kal a, Isua ke bulah a bawkkhup a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />a fanu mal kum sâwm leh pahnih vêl mi chu thi chhâwnga a lum reng avângin a ina kalah a ngên a. A kal ta a, innêk tûlh tûlh khawpa mipui nasain an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhe pakhat kum sâwm leh pahnih thi pût tawh, a sum neih zawng zawng pawh daktor laka sêng zo tawh, tu man an tihdam theih loh chu a hnungah a lo kal a, a puan fêm chu a rawn dek a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />chawplehchilhin a thi pût chu a reh ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Isuan, “Mi dek kha tu nge ni?” a ti a. ‘Kei chu ka ni lo’ an ti ṭheuh va, Peteran “Hotupa, mipuiin an zîm huai huai che a, an nêk nuk nuk che alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nimahsela Isuan, “Tu emaw zawngin mi dek a ni, thiltihtheihna ka chhûng ata a chhuak tih ka hria a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan inthup rual a ni ta lo tih a hriatin, khûr chungin a lo kal a, a hmaah a bawkkhup a, a deh chhan leh chawplehchilha a dam tâk mai thu mi zawng zawng hmaah a hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka fanu, i rinna hi i dam phah a ni e, thlamuang takin kal rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A la ṭawng lai mêkin Jaira in ata mi pakhat a lo kal a. “I fanu a thi ta, zirtîrtu hi tihah duh suh,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Isuan a lo hria a. Jaira hnênah, “Hlau suh, ring mai la, a dam leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />In chu a va thlen chuan Petera te, Johana te, Jakoba te leh naupang nu leh pa chauh lo chu tu ma luh ve a phal lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />An za chuan an âwm chûm vak vakin an lo ṭah tuar tuar a. Nimahsela, ani chuan, “Ṭap suh u, a thi lo ve, a muhîl a ni zâwk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />A thi tawh ngei tih an hriat avângin an nuihsan mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Isua chuan a kut a chelh a, “Mami, tho rawh,” a ti a, a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />A thlarau chu a lo kîr leh a, a tho ta nghâl a, “Ei tûr eng emaw pe rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />A nu leh pa chuan mak an ti êm êm a; nimahsela, thil awm dân chu mi dang hrilh a khap tlat a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sâwmpahnihte chu a ko khâwm a, ramhuai tin rêng chunga thiltihtheihna leh thuneihna a pe a, nâte tihdam theihna pawh a pe bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ram thu hril tûr leh damlote tidam tûrin a tîr chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Zin kawng atân tiang te, iptê te, chhang te, tangka te eng mah keng suh u; kawr pahnih pawh keng suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In kalna apiangah in thlen in ngaiah thleng reng ula, chuta ṭang ngei chuan chhuak leh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangni lo ngaihsak lo che u khua chu, in chhuahsan hunah an tihdik lohzia hriattîr nân in kephaha vaivut chu thing thla ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, an chhuak ta a, khaw tin an fang a, hmun tinah Chanchin Ṭha hrilin mite an tidam zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal Heroda chuan chûng thil chu a lo hre ve a. Ṭhenkhatin, “Johana kha mitthi zîng ata a tho leh ta a ni,” te an ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a ṭhenin, “Elija a lo inlâr ta a ni,” te an ti a; a ṭhenin, “Hmânlai zâwlnei tu emaw kha a lo tho leh ta a ni,” te an tih avâng chuan a ngaihna a hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Heroda chuan, “Johana chu a lu ka tansak tawh kha! A chanchin heti kauva nasa ka hriat hi tu nge ni ta?” a ti a, amah chu hmuh a tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tirhkohte kha an lo haw a, a hnênah an thiltihte an rawn sawi a. Anni chu a hruai a, Bethsaida an tih khuaah chuan a kal hranpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, mipuiho chuan an hriatin an zui ve ta a. Anni chu a lo lâwm a, Pathian ram thu a lo hrilh a, tihdam ngai apiang a tidam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni a tlâk dâwn lai chuan Sâwmpahnihte chu an lo kal a, “Mipuiho hi kan kiang vêl khuaahte leh lovahte thlen in leh ei tûr zawngin kaltîr ta che, hmun thlalêra awm kan nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Nangmahnin ei tûr pe rawh u,” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Chhang panga leh sangha pahnih bak kan nei hlei nêm - hêng mi zawng zawng ei tûr kan va lei ngawt loh chuan,” an ti a. Patling ngawt pawh sângnga lai an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chuan zirtîrte hnênah, “A pâwl pâwlin ṭhuttîr rawh u, sawmnga vêl zêlin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutiang chuan an ti a, an ṭhuttîr ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chhang panga leh sangha pahnih chu a la a, vân lam enin malsâwmna a sawi a, a phel a, mipui hnêna sem tûrin zirtîrte chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An zavai chuan an ei a, an tlai ta ṭheuh va; an sem bâng chu an la khâwm a, bâwm sâwm leh pahnih khat a la ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vawi khat chu fianriala a ṭawngṭai laiin a zirtîrte pawh an awm ve a, an hnênah, “Mipuiten tu nge nia min sawi?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anni chuan, “ ‘Baptistu Johana,’ ti che an awm a, a ṭhenin ‘Elija,’ an ti che a, ṭhenkhat erawh chuan ‘hmânlai zâwlneite zînga tu emaw tholeh ta,’ ni âwmin an sawi che,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chuan, “A nih, nangnin tu nge nia mi hriat?” a ti a. Petera chuan, “Pathian Krista chu,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, chu chu tu mah hrilh lo tûrin thu a pe tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihring Fapa hian thil tam tak a tuar tûr a ni; upate, puithiam lalte, Dân zirtîrtuten an hnâwl ang a, an tihlum dâwn a; amaherawhchu, ni thum chinah kaihthawh a ni ngei dâwn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawng hnênah, “Tu pawh mi zui duh chuan mahni inngaihtuah chang lovin, ni tin mahni kraws puin mi zui rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu pawh mahni nun humhim tum chuan an chân ang a, tu pawh keimah avânga nun chân chuan an humhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Miin khawvêl hi a pumin nei sela, amah chuan chhiat phahin, boral phah si sela, a tân eng nge sâwt ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka thu leh kei mi zahpui apiang chu, Mihring Fapa pawhin a ropuina nên, Pa leh vântîrhkoh thianghlimte ropuina nêna a lo kal hunah anni chu a la rawn zahpui ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dik takin ka hrilh a che u, heta dingho ṭhenkhat hi, Pathian ram an hmuh hma chu thi lo tûr an awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng thu a sawi aṭanga ni riat lai hnuah chuan, Petera te, Johana te, Jakoba te hruaiin, ṭawngṭai tûrin tlângah a chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutia a ṭawngṭai lai chuan a hmêl lan dân chu a lo danglam ta a, a puante chu a vâr ta sur mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ngai teh, mi pahnihin an rawn kâwm a, chûng mite chu Mosia leh Elija an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />ropui takin an rawn inlâr a, Jerusalem-a a thih tleitlâkna tûr chungchâng an sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Petera leh a ṭhiante chu an mut a chhuak hle a, an han harh chian chuan a ropuina leh a bula mi pahnih dingte chu an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Isua an ṭhen dâwn lai chuan Peteran, “Hotupa, heta kan awm hi a ṭha e, bâwkte pathum kan khawh ang e, i tân pakhat, Mosia tân pakhat, Elija tân pakhat,” a ti a, eng nge a sawi pawh a hre mumal lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chûng thu chu a sawi lai mêkin chhûm a lo zîng a, anniho chu a rawn khuh a, chhûmin a rawn chîm chuan an hlau hle a. Chhûm aṭang chuan aw a lo chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Hei hi ka mi thlan, ka Fapa chu a ni; ama thu hi ngai rawh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aw a reh hnu chuan Isua chauh chu an hmu a. Chûng lai chuan an thil hmuh chu an ngawihpui tlat a, tu mah eng mah an hrilh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A tûka tlâng ata an chhuk chu mipui nasa takin an lo hmuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mipui zînga pa pakhat chu a au chhuak a, “Zirtîrtu, ka fapa, ka fa neih chhun chu, en tûrin ka ngên a che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />thlarauvin a man fo mai a, a khawih ṭê tuar tuar ṭhîn a, chilphuan tla bawrh bawrhin a sawisa a, thi ang dêrin a kalsan ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />I zirtîrte hi hnawt chhuak tûra ka ngên lahin an thei si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Tûnlai mi, rinna tlachham leh tihmawhte u, eng chen nge in hnênah ka awm anga, ka dawh theih dâwn che u? I fapa chu han hruai teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A rawn hruai laiin ramhuai chuan a ṭhuai thlu a, a sawisa nek a. Nimahsela, Isuan thlarau bawlhhlawh chu a hau va, naupang chu a tidam a, a pa hnênah chuan a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng chuan Pathian ropuizia chu mak an ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mi zawng zawngin a thil tihte mak tia an ngaihsân êm êm lai chuan a zirtîrte hnênah, “Hêng thu hi nangni bengah chuan châm reng rawh se. Mihring Fapa hi mihringte kuta mantîr a ni dâwn si a,” a ti a. Nimahsela, a thu sawi chu a ngaihna an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />An hriatthiam theih loh nân an lakah thup a ni; chu thu chu amah lah an zâwt fiah ngam bawk si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />An zîngah tu nge ropui ber ang tih thu-ah an lo inhnial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Isuan an thil ngaihtuah chu a hria a, naupang tê hi a kai a, a bulah a dintîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />an hnênah, “Tu pawh he naupang hi ka hming avânga lâwm chu kei mi lâwm a ni; kei mi lâwm chu mi tîrtu lâwm a ni; in zînga tê ber hi a ni ropui ber,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, Johana chuan ani chu a bia a, “Hotupa, mi pakhat i hminga ramhuaite hnawt chhuak kan hmu a, keini anga a zui ve loh che avângin khap kan lo tum asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Khap suh u. Tu pawh dodâl lo che u chu in lamṭang an ni ngai e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Amah hruai chhoh hun a lo hnaih chuan Jerusalem-a kal a tum lui tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A hmaah lamkal a tlântîr a. Anni chu an kal a, a tân engkim lo buatsaih fel tûrin Samari mite khaw pakhatah an lût a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />mahse, Jerusalem pana kal zêl a tum tlat avângin an lo ngaihsak lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tichuan, a zirtîr Jakoba leh Johana chuan chu chu an han hmuh ve chuan, “Lalpa, hêngho kan hlum vek nân hian vân ata mei ko thla ila i duh em?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ani erawh chu a han lehhawi a, a kamkhat a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />khaw dangah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Kalkawnga an kal laiin mi pakhatin a hnênah, “I kalna apiangah ka zui ang che,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Isuan, “Sihalten kua an nei a, chunglêng savate pawhin riahhmun an nei; Mihring Fapa erawh hi chuan lu nghahna hmun tûr a nei lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Mi dang hnênah, “Mi zui rawh,” a ti ve thung a. Ani chuan, “Lalpa, ka pa ka va vui ta zet ang e aw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Isua erawh chuan, “Mitthiin anmahni mitthi chu lo vui mai rawh se; nang erawh chuan Pathian ram thu hi va hril darh zâwk rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Mi dangin, “Lalpa, ka zui ang che, amaherawhchu, in lama mite ka va chibai zet ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Chu mi hnênah chuan Isuan, “Leilehnaa kut nghat reng chunga hnung lam hawi bawk si chu tu mah Pathian ram mi ni tlâk an awm lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan Lalpan mi dang sawmsarih a ruat a, an kalna tûr khaw tinah leh hmun tinah lo kal hmasa tûrin pahnih zêlin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An hnênah, “Buh seng tûr a tam tehlul nên, thawktu lah an tlêm si. Chutichuan, a buh seng tûra mi tîr tûrin buh Neitupa dîl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kal ta ula, chinghne zînga berâmno lût angin ka tirh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tangka ip te, iptê te, pheikhawk te keng suh u; kalkawngah tu mah chibai bûk hek suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In thlen in apiangah, ‘He inah hian thlamuanna thleng rawh se,’ ti hmasa zêl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu inah chuan thlamuanna ngaina mi an lo awm chuan, in thlamuanna thu chu an chungah awm sela, an awm loh erawh chuan in hnênah lo kîr leh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi in hlîrah chuan chêng ula, an pêk apiang che u eiin in ang che u, hnathawktu chu hlawh hmu tlâk a ni. In hrang hrangah thleng lâwr suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tin, khua in luhna apiangah an lo lawm che u chuan, an hlui che u apiang ei ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />damlo awmte pawh tidam ula, an hnênah, ‘Pathian ram chu in hnênah a lo thleng ta,’ ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In luhna khuaten an lo ngaihsak loh che u chuan, in chhuahsan pahin an kawtlaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘In khaw vaivut takngial pawh hi kan kai duh lo ve, kan kephah ata kan vuak fai hi; Pathian ram in hnênah a lo thleng ta tih erawh chu lo hre rawh u,’ in ti dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u. Rorêl ni-ah chuan chu khaw tuar tûr ai chuan Sodom khaw tuar tûr chu a ziaawm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Nang Korazin, i chung a pik e. Nang Bethsaida, i chung a pik e; in zînga thil mak tihte kha Tura leh Sidona tih ni sela, saiip puan sina vaivut zîngah ṭhuin an simzia an tilang daih tawh tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rorêlnaah chuan in tuar tûr aiin Tura leh Sidon tuar tûr chu a ziaawm zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang pawh, Kapernaum, vân thlenga chawisân i ni dâwn êm ni? Mitthi khaw thlenga nam thlâk asin i nih dâwn!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“In thu awih chuan ka thu pawh an awih ang, a hnâwl che u chuan kei pawh mi hnâwl a ni; tin, kei mi hnâwltu chuan mi tîrtu pawh a hnâwl a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sawmsarihte chu hlim takin an lo haw leh a, “Lalpa, ramhuaite pawh i hming avângin kan thu thuin an awm,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Vân ata ṭêk anga Setana tla ṭhuai kha ka lo hmu reng asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai teh u, rûl te, khawmualkaikuang te, hmêlmapa chakna zawng zawngte rah beh theihna thu ka pêk che u hi, eng mahin a tina hauh lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, thlaraute in thu thu-a an awm avâng hian lâwm suh u, vâna in hming ziak a nih avângin lâwm zâwk rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi lai tak chuan Thlarau Thianghlimah a lâwm ta êm êm a. “Aw ka Pa, lei leh vân Lalpa, nangin mi fingte leh mi thiamte lakah hêng thu hi i thup tlat a, mi mâwlte hnêna i puan avângin ka fak a che; a ni, ka Pa, chutiang chu ṭha i tih zâwng tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka pain engkim mi kawltîr tawh; Fapa hi tu nge a nih Pa chauh lo chuan tu man an hre lo; Pa pawh chu tu nge a nih, Fapa leh an hnêna Fapain a puan duhnate chauh lo chuan tu man an hre lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte lam a hawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, zâwlneite leh lal tam takte pawhin in thil hmuhte hi hmuh an lo duh ṭhîn a, an hmu si lo; in ngaihthlâkte hi ngaihthlâk an duh a; mahse, an ngaithla si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ṭum khat chu Dânhremi pakhat hi a ding a, amah fiah nân, “Zirtîrtu, chatuan nun nei tûrin eng nge ka tih tûr?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Dân bu-ah eng nge chuang? A eng lai nge in chhiar ziah ṭhin kha?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan, “ ‘Lalpa i Pathian chu i thinlung zawng zawngin, i nunna zawng zawngin, i chakna zawng zawngin, i rilru zawng zawngin i hmangaih tûr a ni; nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte pawh i hmangaih tûr a ni,’ tih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isua chuan, “I chhâng dik e, chutiang chuan ti la, i nung ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan thiam inchantîr a duh a, Isua hnênah, “A nih leh ka vêngte chu tute nge?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Mi pakhat, Jerusalem aṭanga Jeriko khuaa kal tûr chu, kawng lakah suamhmanghovin an lo bei a, a silhfênte chu an hlihsak a, an vaw nek a, thi chhâwngin an kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chumi kawngah chuan puithiam pakhat a zu kal hlauh va, ani chu a han hmuh chuan a hêl ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin Levia chi mi pakhat pawhin chumi hmun chu a lo thleng a, ani chu a han hmuh chuan a hêl ve ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Samari mi pakhat zin kal chuan a awmna chu a lo thleng ve a, ani chu a han hmuh chuan a khawngaih ta êm êm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />a va pan a, a pemte chu hriak leh uain hnawihin a tuamsak ta a; ama sabengtung chungah a chuantîr a, khualbûkah a kalpui a, a enkawl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A tûkah chuan duli pahnih a phawrh a, khualbûk enkawltu chu a pe a, ‘Lo enkawl la, hemi bâka i sên zawng chu ka lo kîr leh hunah ka rawn rûl ang che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Aw le, chûng mi pathum zînga tu ber chu nge suamhmang tâwktu vêngte nia i rin?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ani chuan, “A khawngaihtu chu,” a ti a. Isuan, “Nang pawh chutiang bawk chuan va ti ve rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An kal pah chuan khaw pakhatah an lût a, hmeichhe pakhat Marthii an tih chuan a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Laizâwn pakhat, Mari an tih chu a nei a. Mari chuan Lalpa ke bula ṭhuin a thu a ngaithla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Marthii erawh chu ei tûr buatsaihin a indaih lo hle a, a hnênah a lo kal a, “Lalpa, ka laizâwnnuin keimah chauh che tûra mi ring mai hi ṭha i ti em ni? Mi rawn pui se a ṭha lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a chhâng a, “Marthi, Marthi, ngaihtuah i ngah a, i buai hle tak e; mahse, thil ṭûl tak pakhat a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Mari chuan chan ṭha a thlang a, chhuhsak tûr a ni lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vawi khat chu hmun pakhatah a ṭawngṭai a. A han bân chuan a zirtîrte zînga pakhatin a hnênah, “Lalpa, Johanan a zirtîrte ṭawngṭai dân a zirtîr ang khân min zirtîr ve ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “In ṭawngṭaiin heti hian ti ang che u: ‘Kan Pa, I hming zahin awm rawh se, I ram lo thleng rawh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni tin ei tûr chaw min pe ang che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan sualte min ngaidam la, Keini pawhin kan chunga tisual apiang kan ngaidam ṭhîn. Thlêmnaah min hruai lût suh ang che,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hnênah, “In zînga mi pakhatin ṭhian nei sela, zânlaiah a hnêna va kalin, ‘ṭhiana, chhang tlang thum min pûktîr teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ka ṭhian zinin mi rawn tlawh thut a, a hmaa hlui tûr eng mah ka nei lo,’ va ti sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />in chhûnga mi chuan, ‘Mi rawn tibuai suh, tûnah zawng kawng pawh kan kalh diam tawh a, ka fate nên khumah kan mu tawh, thovin ka rawn pe thei lo che,’ tihsan sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ka hrilh a che u, a ṭhian a nih avângin thovin va pe lo mah se, a dîl ngut ngut avângin thovin a duh zât zât a pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Chutichuan, ka hrilh a che u, dîl ula, pêk in ni ang; zawng ula, in hmu ang; kik ula, hawnsak in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A dîl apiangin an dawng ṭhîn, a zawng apiangin an hmu bawk ṭhîn. Tu pawh a kik chu an hawnsak dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In zînga pa, a fapain sangha dîl sela, tu nge sangha aiah rûl pe ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Artui aiah pawh tuin nge khawmualkaikuang pe ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, nangni mi sual mahin in fate thil ṭha pêk nachâng in hriat si chuan, in Pa vâna mi chuan a dîltute chu Thlarau Thianghlim a va pe dâwn êm!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ramhuai ṭawngtheilo pakhat hi a hnawt chhuak a, ramhuai chu a lo chhuah hnu chuan ṭawng thei lo chu a lo ṭawng thei ta a, mipui chuan mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An zînga ṭhenkhat chuan, “Ramhuai lal Belzebula vâng alâwm ramhuaite a hnawh chhuah le,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ṭhen erawh chuan amah fiah nân vân ata chhinchhiahna thil mak entîr an phût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan an tih chhan a lo hria a, “Khawii ram pawh mahni indo chu an ṭiau ṭhîn: chhûngkua pawh mahni indo chu a kehchhe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Setana pawh mahni a indo chuan engtin nge a ram chu a din theih ang? Belzebula vângin ramhuaite hnawt chhuakah min puh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keiin Belzebula vângin hnawt chhuak ni ila, in mite khân tu vângin nge ramhuai an lo hnawh chhuah ṭhin? Tichuan, anni khân asin thiam loh chantîr zâwk dâwn che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian kut avânga ramhuai hnawt chhuak ka nih si chuan in hnênah Pathian ram chu a lo thleng ta tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mi chak chuan hriam famkim nên a in a vên chuan, a sum chu a him ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />amaherawhchu, a aia chak zâwkin a rawn beiha, a rawn hneh chuan, a rin chhan râlthuam chu a chhuhsak ang a, a sum pawh a lâksak ang a, a duh duhin a sem darh mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka lama ṭang lo tawh phawt chuan mi do a ni, mi lâk khâwmpui lo chuan a tidarh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Thlarau bawlhhlawh chu mi kawchhûng ata a chhuahin chawlhhmun zawngin tui awm lohna hmunahte a vâk a vâk a; mahse, a hmuh loh avâng chuan, ‘Ka in, ka chhuahsan tâkah khân ka kîr leh mai teh ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a va thlen chuan phiah faia tihfel diamin a va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, a kal a, a aia sual hlîr thlarau dang pasarih a hruai a, an lo lût a, tah chuan awmhmun an khuar ta a; chu mihring awmze hnuhnûng zâwk chu a hmasa aiin a lo chhe daih ṭhîn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chûng thu chu a sawi laiin mipui zînga nu pakhat a lo au chhuak a, “I paina pum chu a nihlawh e, i hnute hnêk pawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “A ni, mahse, Pathian thu hriaa zâwmte hi mi nihlawh an ni zâwk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, mipui an lo pung khâwm chiam a, Isuan, “Tûnlai mite hi sual tak an ni; chhinchhiahna thil mak an phût a, Jona chhinchhiahna chauh lo chu chhinchhiahna thil mak rêng entîr an ni lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jona chu Ninevi mite tân chhinchhiahna a ni ang khân, Mihring Fapa hi tûnlai mite tân chhinchhiahna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Chhim lam lalnu kha Rorêl ni-ah chuan tûnlai mite rual hian a tho ve ang a, thiam loh a chantîr ang: Solomona finna ngaithla tûr mahin kâwlkil ata a lo kal si a; ngai teh u, Solomona aia ropui zâwk hetah hian a awm asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ninevi mite chu Rorêl ni-ah tûnlai mite nên hian an ding za ang a, thiam loh an chantîr ang. Jona thu hril avângin an sim si a; ngai teh u, Jona aia ropui zâwk hetah hian a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Tu man an khâwnvâr hâl chu hmun biru takah an dah ngai lo va, khovin an khuh ngai hek lo, a lo lûtten khua an hmuh theih nân a dahnaah an dah zâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“I mit hi i taksa tân khâwnvâr ang a ni; i mit a dik chuan i taksa pum chu a êng vek ang, a dik loh erawh chuan i pumin a thim vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Fîmkhur rawh, nangmaha êng awm chu thim a lo ni hlauh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Thim lai awm lova, i taksa pum a ên vek erawh chuan khâwnvâr êngin a chhun êng che ang hian i pumin i êng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chûng thu a sawi lai chuan Farisai pakhatin chaw eiah a sâwm a; tichuan, a zui lût a, chaw chu a kîl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Farisai chuan chaw ei dâwna kut a sil lo chu mak a ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Nangni Farisai-te hian no leh thlêng pâwn lam in sil fai ṭhîn tak a, in chhûng lam erawh chu duhâmna leh suahsualnain a khat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />In va â êm! Pâwn lam siamtuin chhûng lam pawh a siam a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />No leh thlêng chhûnga thil awm chu mi rethei pe ula chuan, in tân engkim a thianghlim mai tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“A ni, nangni Farisai te u, in chung a pik e; lêngmasêr te, pudina te leh thlai tinrêng sâwma pakhat in pe ṭhîn, dik taka tih leh Pathian hmangaih erawh chu in ngaihthah si ṭhîn; chu chu asin in tih ngei ngei tûr chu, a dangte pawh khi tih ṭhulh chuang lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nangni Farisai-te u, in chung a pik e, sunagog-a ṭhutna hmasa berte leh dâwr hmuna chibai bûk te in ngaina si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />In chung a pik e, thlân tih hriat loh, a chunga hre lova mi an kal ṭhinna ang hi in ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Dânhremi pakhat chuan, “Zirtîrtu, hêng thu i sawi hian keini pawh min dem tel a nih hi,” tiin a lo chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Dânhremite u, nangni pawh in chung a pik e; phur hrehawm tak tak mite in bel ṭhîn a, nangniho lah chuan in kutzungṭang tê pawhin in khawih duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />In chung a pik e, in pate thah zâwlneiho thlân inte in sa a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />in thlahtute thil tih chu in hriatpui a, in remtihpui tihna a ni; annin a thah an tum a, nangnin an thlân in sak in tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Chuvângin alâwm, Pathian Finna bu-ah pawh, ‘An hnênah zâwlneite leh tirhkohte ka tîr ang, a ṭhen an that ang a, a ṭhen an tiduhdah ang,’ tih ziak a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Chutichuan, Abela thah aṭanga maichâm leh Hmun Thianghlim inkâra Zakaria thah thleng khân, leilung pian tirh aṭanga zâwlnei zawng zawng thah thisen phuba chu tûnlai mite chungah hian lâk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A ni, ka hrilh a che u, tûnlai mite chungah hian phuba chu lâk a ni dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Nangni Dânhremite u, in chung a pik e, Finna chabi chu in kawl bo daih a, nangni lah lût duh si lovin, a lût tûrte in khap bawk si,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan a chhuak a, Dân zirtîrtute leh Farisai-te chuan an tai ṭan ta a; thu tam tak an zâwt sek a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />a ṭawng sual palh man tumin an châng ta reng a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutih chhûng chuan mipui sâng tam tak inrap nûlh nûlh khawp an lo pung khâwm a, ani chuan thu a sawi a, a zirtîrte hnênah phei chuan, “Farisai-te dawidim vervêkna lakah chuan fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eng mah thup hlen theih a ni lo, a lang leh mai ṭhîn; eng mah zêp hlen theih a ni hek lo, hriat chhuah a ni leh mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zân thima sawi chu a tûk êngah miin an hria ang, pindan chhûngrila in sawi rûk chu in chunga chuangin an tlângaupui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka ṭhiante u, ka hrilh a che u, taksa tihluma, chumi hnua eng mah tih thei tawh lo che u chu hlau suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu nge hlauh tûr ka hrilh ang che u; taksa tihluma, chumi hnu pawha hremhmuna paih theitu che u chu hlau rawh u; a ni, ka hrilh a che u, amah mawlh chu hlau rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chawngzawng panga pawisa pahnihin an hralh ṭhîn lo vem ni? Pathian erawh chuan an zînga pakhat tê mah a hmaih ngai lo. In samzaite lam pawh a chhiar vek asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hlau suh u, chawngzawng tam tak aiin in hlu zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka hrilh a che u, mite hmaa mi ṭan apiang chu Pathian vântirhkohte hmaah Mihring Fapa hian a ṭan ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, mite hmaa mi phat chu Pathian vântirhkohte hmaah a phat ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Mihring Fapa chu an sawisêl pawhin an sawisêlna chu ngaihdam a ni ang; amaherawhchu, Thlarau Thianghlim meuh pawi sawi chu ngaihdam a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tin, sunagog hotute leh thuneitute hmaa an hruai hunah che u chuan, chhân dân tûr emaw, in sawi tûr emaw engto suh ang che u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a hun takah Thlarau Thianghlim chuan in sawi tûr a hrilh dâwn che u a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mipui zînga pakhat chuan, “Zirtîrtu, ka unaupa hnênah ka pa ro mi sem ve tûrin mi hrilhsak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Mihring, nangni tân rorêltuah leh ro semtuah tu nge mi siam?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Fîmkhur ula, awhna rêng rêng lakah invêng rawh u; mihring nunna hi a hausaknaah a innghat lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An hnênah tehkhin thu a sawi a: “Mi hausa tak pakhat hi a lo a hlâwk êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, a inngaihtuah a, ‘Engtin nge ka tih tâk ang? Ka buh leh bâl dah khâwmna ka nei sêng ta si lo,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Heti hian ka ti teh ang; ka buh inte ka ṭhiat ang a, a aia lianin ka sa ang a; chutah chuan ka buh leh bâl leh ka sum zawng zawng ka chhêk khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, ‘Pa vânnei! Kum rei tak daih sum tam tak i khâwl tâk hi; châwl la, eiin bâr la, nuam takin awm rawh, ka ti ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathianin a hnênah, ‘Mi â, zânin hian i nun an lâksak dâwn che a ni. I thil deh chhuahte kha tuten nge nei ta ang?’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mahni tâna sum khâwla, Pathian lama ngah si lo chu, chuti mai chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Chuvângin, ka hrilh a che u, nun nân eng nge in ei anga, in taksa tân eng nge in sin ang tih lungkham suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ei tûr aiin nunna a pawimawh zâwk a, silhfên aiin taksa a pawimawh zâwk bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Choakte hi ngaihtuah teh mah u, buh an tuh lo va, an seng hek lo, zêm an nei lo va, buh in pawh an nei hek lo; nimahsela, Pathianin a châwm ṭhîn; nangni hi savate ai chuan in hlu zâwk daih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nangni zîngah lungkham avângin tu nge mahni nun tisei hret thei
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hemi tê pawh ti thei si lo, engati nge thil dang in lungkham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tûktinpâr ṭhan dânte hi ngaihtuah teh u, hna an thawk lo va, la an dek hek lo; nimahsela, ka hrilh a che u, Solomona meuh pawh a ropui thei ang bera a inthuam khân, hêng tûktinpâr pakhat tluk pawh hian chei a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, ram hnim, vawiina nung, a tûka meia tuah leh mai tûr mah Pathianin chuti kauva a chei si chuan, aw nangni, rin tlêmte u, chûngte ai chuan a va thuam nasa zâwk dâwn che u êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangni zawng, ei leh in tûr ngaihtuahin buai phili suh ula, mangang hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hêng hi khawvêl mi zawng zawng buaipui ber a ni; in Pain hêngte hi nangni pawhin in mamawh ve tho tih a hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama ram chu zawng zâwk ula, tichuan, hêngte pawh hi a pêk belhchhah dâwn che u nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pâwl tlêmte u, hlau suh u, ram pêk che u hi in Pa lâwmzâwng tak a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“In neih apiang hralh ula, pachhiate pe rawh u, vânah, rûkru kal lohnaah, thîm ei theih lohnaah chuan, tangka ip phai thei lo te, sum ral thei lo te insiam rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />In ro awmna apiangah in rilru pawh a awm ṭhin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Insiam sa diamin, khâwnvâr chhit sa nên inpeih reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />An pu lawichaw ei hawin kawngkhâr a rawn kik lo hawn vat thei tûra nghâk rengte ang hian awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An pu lo hâwngin amah lo nghâk rengtu bawih a rawn hmuh chu an nihlawh e. Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, ani chu a insiam ang a, anni chu chaw a kîltîr ang a, an chaw ei a vil ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Zânlaiah emaw, khawvâr lamah emaw a lo hâwna, chutianga bawih a rawn hmuhte chu an nihlawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hei hi in hria e, rûkru lo kal hun tûr in neituin hria sela, a vêng ang a, a in a reh pawhtîr lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nangni pawh inpeih rengin awm rawh u, Mihring Fapa chu in beisei loh hunah a lo kal hlauh dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Petera chuan, “Lalpa, he tehkhin thu hi keimahni chauh nge min hrilh mi zawng zawng?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “An puin a chhiahhlawhte hotu-ah leh an chaw sem huna semsak ṭhîntu atân sum enkawltu rinawm tak leh fing tak a ruat tûra chu tu nge ni ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />An pu lo kal huna bawih chutianga ti a rawn hmuh chu a nihlawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Dik takin ka hrilh a che u, a neih zawng zawng chunga hotu-ah a rawn siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, bawih chuan, ‘Ka pu hi a lo haw lawk dâwn lo ve,’ ti rilruin bawih dangte chu a hmei a pain lo vêl sela, eiin lo rui buai hle mai sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />chu bawiha pu chu a rin loh ni-ah, a hriat loh dârah a lo kal ang a, bung hnihah a rawn chhuah ang a, mi rinawm lote chan a rawn chantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Bawih, an pu duhzâwng hre reng chunga ti lo leh inpeih lo chu na taka vuak an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hriat loh avânga hremna khawp thil ti chu nêp deuhva vuak an ni ang. Tam tak an pêk apiangte lakah chuan tam tak an phût ang, tam tak an kawltîr apiangte lakah tam tak an beisei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />“Khawvêlah mei chhuah tûra lo kal ka ni, tûnah pawh hian kâng tawh pang se ka va ti êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Baptisma chan tûr pawh ka nei, chumi ka tlingtlâk hma chu ka thaw a va pik êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Leiah hian rem lêntîr tûra lo kal emaw mi ti elo? Hnai lo ve, ka hrilh a che u, do lêntîr tûra lo kal ka ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tûn hnuah chuan chhûng khata mi panga an indo vang a, pathumte chuan pahnihte chu an do vang a, pahnihten pathumte chu an do vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Pain a fapa a do vang a, fapain a pa: nuin a fanu a do vang a, fanuin a nu; nuin a mo a do vang a, movin a nu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, mipui hnênah pawh chuan, “Khawthlang lama chhûm lo chhuak in hmuhin, ‘ruah a sûr dâwn e,’ in ti nghâl ṭhîn a, a sûr ngei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Chhim thli a lo tleh lahin, ‘khua a lum dâwn,’ in ti a, a lum ngei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Nangni mi vervêkte u, lei leh vân enin khaw chin in hrethiam thei si a, engtizia nge tûnlai hun awm dân hi in hriatthiam theih loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />“A dik leh dik lo chu engati nge nangni pawhin in thliar mai loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Thuneitu hmaa i khingpui nên in lan dâwnin, kal pahin a laka fihlîmna kawng zawng hrâm rawh, chuti lo chu rorêltu hmaah a hnûk lût hlauh dah ang che. Rorêltu chuan pulis hnênah a hlân ang chia, pulis chuan tân inah a khung ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, pawisa pakhat tê pawh in tlâk kim hma chu chuta ta chu in chhuak tawp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutih lai tak chuan tute emaw an lo kal a, Galili rama mi, Pathian be lai, an inthawina ran thisen leh an thisen inpawlh nuaia Pilatan a thah thu an rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Chûng Galili mite chu, chutiang thil an tuar avângin Galili mi dang zawngte aia sual bîk niin in ring êm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sual bîk suh e, ka hrilh a che u, nangni pawh in sim loh chuan chutiang bawkin in boral ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nih leh, Siloam in sângin a delh hlum mi sâwm leh pariatte pawh kha, Jerusalem-a chêng zawngte aia sual bîk niin in ring êm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sual bîk suh e, ka hrilh a che u, nangni pawh in sim loh chuan chutiang bawkin in boral ve ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He tehkhin thu hi a sawi bawk a: “Mi pakhatin grep huanah theipui kûng khat a phun a, a rah a zawng ṭhîn a, pakhat mah a hmu ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Grep huanpu hnênah chuan, ‘En teh, kum thum zet he theipui rah hi ka zawng tawh a, ka hmu ngai lo. Hmun a awh mai mai a ni lâwm ni? Kit mai rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘Ka pu, kumin tal hi chu awm leh teh se, a vêlin ka lai ang a, êk dûrin ka vûr rih ang e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a rah tâk leh a ṭha ang a, a rah loh leh kit mai ang che,’ a ti a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sabat vawi khat chu sunagog pakhatah mi a zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmeichhe pakhat, kum sâwm leh pariat thlarau sualin a tihnat tawh a lo awm a, a kun reng a, a ding char thei tawh hauh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isuan ani chu a han hmuhin a ko va, “Hmeichhia, i natna chuan a thlah ta a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A chungah chuan a kut a nghat a, a ding char thei ta nghâl a. Pathian a fak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Isuan sabat nia mi a tihdam avâng chuan sunagog hotu chu a thinur hle a, mite hnênah chuan, “Hna thawhna tûr ni ruk a awm a, chumi chhûngin lo kal ula, intidam ta che u, sabat ni ber kher ni lovin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa erawh chuan an hnênah, “Nangni vervêkte u, sabat ni pawha mahni sebâwng emaw, sabengtung emaw phelha, a thlunna hmun ata tui in tûra hruai chhuak lo tu nge awm che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />He nu pawh hi Abrahama fanu a ni si a. Setanan kum sâwm leh pariat zet a lo phuar tawh a, chu phuarna chu sabat ni pawhin phelhsak tûr a ni dâwn lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng thu chu a han sawi chuan a hmêlmate chu an zak hle a, mipui erawh chu a thiltih ropui takte avâng chuan an lâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, ani chuan, “Pathian ram chu eng ang nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anṭam chi fang khat miin a lâka, huana a theh ang hi a ni; a lo ṭiak a, thing a lo ni a, chunglêng savate a zârah an riak ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Pathian ram chu eng nên nge ka han tehkhin leh ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dawidim hmeichhiain a lâka, chhangphut fawng thum zînga a zavaia fan chhuak vek tûra a phul ang chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani chuan zirtîr chung zêlin Jerusalem a pan a, khaw lian leh khaw tête a tlawh zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu-in emaw, “Lalpa, chhandamte chu an tlêm hle elo?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Kawngka zîmah chuan luh tum hrâm rawh u; ka hrilh a che u, mi tam takin luh an tum ang a, an thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In neitupa a thawha, kawng a kalh tawh hnu chuan, nangnin pâwna dingin, ‘ka pu, kawng min hawn rawh,’ tiin va kik mah ula, ani chuan, ‘Khawi lama mi nge in nih ka hre lo va che u,’ tiin a lo chhâng dah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nangnin, ‘I hovin kan eia kan in ṭhin kha, kan kawtthlêrahte pawh i zirtîr ṭhin kha,’ in la ti ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ani erawh chuan, ‘Ka hrilh a che u, khawi lama mi nge in nih ka hre lo a che u; nangni thil sual ti zawng zawngte u, ka hnên ata kal bo vek rawh u,’ a la ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangni pâwna paih chhuah in ni ang a, Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te leh zâwlnei zawng zawngte Pathian ram chhûnga awm in hmu si ang a, chutih hunah chuan in ṭap ang a, ha in ṭhial ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, chhak leh thlang, chhim leh hmâr aṭangin mi an lo kal ang a, Pathian ram ruai chu an rawn kîl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ngai teh u, hnuhnûng berte pawh la hmasa ber tûr an awm a, hmasa berte pawh la hnuhnûng ber tûr an awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutih lai tak chuan Farisai ṭhenkhat an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Chhuak la, heta ta hi kal bo teh, Herodan tihhlum che a tum a ni,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Chu sihal chu heti hian va hrilh rawh u, ‘Ngai rawh, vawiin leh naktûkah hian ramhuaite ka hnawt chhuakin nâte pawh ka tidam ang a, ni thum ni-ah ka zo vang, a ti,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Eng pawh ni se, vawiinah nên, naktûkah nên, a tûk leh thlengin ka ti zêl tûr a ni; Jerusalem pâwn lamah zâwlnei thih theih a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aw, Jerusalem, Jerusalem, zâwlneite thattu, i hnêna tirhte lunga lo dêng hlumtu! Arpuiin a note a thla hnuaia a awp khâwm angin i fate vawi eng zât nge awp khâwm ka tuma, in duh loh kha?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ngai teh u, in in chu rauhsan a ni ta. Ka hrilh a che u, ‘Lalpa hminga lo kal chu fakin awm rawh se,’ in tih hma chuan mi hmu leh tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sabat vawi khat chu Farisai-te zînga hotu lian pakhat inah chaw ei tûrin a kal a, an lo enthla reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, a hmaah chuan damlo pakhat, vûng hi a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dân hremite leh Farisai-te chu a bia a, “Sabat ni hian tihdam a thiang nge thiang lo?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni erawh chu an ngawi reng a. Ani chuan dam lo chu a chelh a, a tidam a, a kaltîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chu a bia a, “Nangni zîngah in fapa emaw, sebâwng emaw tuichhunchhuahah tla sela, sabat ni pawhin tu nge la chhuak var lo vang che u?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu pawh chu an chhâng thei lo bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chaw eia sâwm vete chuan ṭhutna ṭha ṭha an chuh zêl tih a hmuh chuan an hnênah tehkhin thu a sawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tu-in emaw lawichaw eiah a sâwm che u chuan, ṭhutna ṭha berah ṭhu suh ang che u; in aia mi lian a lo sâwm ve hlauh ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a sâwmtu chuan, ‘He mi ṭhutna tûr hi kian rawh,’ a rawn tih mai che u chuan zak takin ṭhutna ṭha lo berah in ṭhu mai tûr a nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An sâwm che chuan ṭhutna ṭha lo berah ṭhu ang che; chutichuan, a sâwmtu che chu a lo kal ang a, i hnênah, ‘ṭhiana, lo ṭhu chho rawh khai,’ a ti ang a, chaw kîlpuite mit hmuhah chawimawiin i awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Inngaihlu apiang an tlâwm ang a, inngaitlâwm apiang chawimawiin an awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah sâwmtu hnênah pawh chuan, “Chhûnah emaw, zânah emaw ruai i ṭhehin i ṭhian te, i unau te, i laichîn te leh i vêng hausa te chu sâwm suh ang che; chuti lo zawng an sâwm ve leh ang chia, an rûl leh kher dah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ruai i ṭheh hun chuan pachhia te, piangsual te, kebai te, mitdel te sâwm zâwk ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tichuan, malsâwmna i dawng ang, rulh vena tûr che an nei dâwn si lo va; mi felte thawhlehnaah chuan rulh leh i ni dâwn nia,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A chaw kîlpui pakhat chuan chu chu a hriatin a hnênah, “Pathian rama ruai ṭheh tûra chu a va nihlawh êm!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan a chhâng a, “Mi tuin emaw zanriah ropui tak a buatsaih a, mi tam tak a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ei hun chuan a mi sâwmte hnênah, ‘Lo kal rawh u le, tûnah engkim peih a ni ta,’ ti tûrin a bawih a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An za chuan inthurual ang maiin an lo pha ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hmasa ber chuan, ‘Lo ka lei a, a enin ka kal a ṭûl a ni; khawngaih takin mi han phatsak ang che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi dangin, ‘Sebâwng tuak nga ka lei a, enfiah tûrin kal ka lo tum a; khawngaih takin mi han phatsak ang che,’ a ti a. Mi dangin, ‘Nupui nei hlim ka ni a; chuvângin, lo kal thei ka ni lo ve,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, bawih chu a hâwng a, chûng thu chu a pu a hrilh a. In neitupa chu a thinur ta a, bawih hnênah chuan, ‘Chhuak thuai la, kawtthlêrah te, kâwmkârah te kal la, pachhia te, piangsual te, mitdel te, kebai te hetah han hruai lût rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, bawih chuan, ‘Ka pu, i thupêk ang khân tih a ni tawh a; mahse, hmun ruak a la awm ta fo mai,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A pu chuan a hnênah ‘Chhuak leh la, lamlianah te, daiah te kal la, ka in khah nân mi han hruai lût hrâm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che, mi ka sâwmte pakhat mah khân ka ruai an ei lo vang,’ a ti a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, a rual chuan mipui nasa tak an kal ve a, a han lehhawi a, an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ka hnêna lo kal apiang chuan an pa te, an nu te, an nupui te, an fa te, an unau te, an farnu te, leh, anmahni nun lam pawh an hawisan si loh chuan ka zirtîr an ni thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi zui duha mahni kraws pu si lo chu ka zirtîr an ni thei hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“In zînga mi hian in sâng sak tum sela, sak zawhna tûr sum a neih dâwn leh dâwn loh tu nge chhût hmasa tê tê lo vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lungphûm dah zet si-a, a sak zawh theih si loh chuan, a en apiangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘He pa hian a rel uaih a, a sa zo leh thei si lo,’ tiin an nuihzat ang asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tin, lal pawh, lal dang do tûrin chhuak dâwn se, ṭhu-a, sipai sîng hnih nêna rawn bei tûr chu sipai sîngkhat nên a lo beih ngam dâwn leh dâwn loh tu nge ngaihtuah hmasa tê tê lo vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A beih ngam dâwn loh chuan hla fea an la awm laiin inremna sawi tûrin palai a tîr ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin nangni zînga mi pawh neih zawng zawng kalsan vek lo apiang chu ka zirtîr an ni thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Chi hi a ṭha e; nimahsela, chi chu da ta ang se, engin nge an tihal leh ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lei tih ṭhat nân a tlâk loh vang a, êk dûra pawlh tlâk a ni hek lo vang a; paih ringawt tûr a ni mai. Ngaihthlâkna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vawi khat chu chhiahkhawntute leh mi sual tam takin a thu ngaihthlâk tumin an rawn pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Farisai-te leh Dân zirtîrtute chuan, “He pa hian mi sualte a kâwm a, chaw te pawh a eipui ṭhîn,” tiin an phunnawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah he tehkhin thu hi a sawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Nangni zîngah tuin emaw berâm za neiin, an zînga pakhat bo ta sela, phûlah sawmkua leh pakua te chu hnutchhiahin, a bo chu a hmuh leh hma chu tu nge zawng lo vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hmuh leh chuan lâwm takin a kokiah a pu ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />in a va thlen chuan a ṭhiante leh a ṭhenawmte a ko khâwm ang a; ‘Ka berâm bo kha ka hmu leh ta, hawh u, i lâwm ang u,’ a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, chutiang bawkin mi fel sawmkua leh pakua sim chuan tûr nei lote chungah ai chuan mi sual pakhat sim chungah vâna mite lâwmna a nasa zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tin, hmeichhia tu pawh duli sâwm neiin pakhat chu hloh ta se, khâwnvâr hâla hmun phiatin, a hmuh leh hma chu tu nge ngun taka zawng lo vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hmuh leh chuan a ṭhiante leh a ṭhenawmte chu a ko khâwm ang a, ‘Ka duli hloh ka hmu leh ta e, hawh u, i lâwm ang u,’ a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, chutiang bawkin Pathian vântirhkohte zîngah chuan mi sual pakhat sim chungah lâwmna a nasa ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sawi zêl a, “Mi pakhat hian fapa pahnih a nei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a naupang zâwk chuan a pa hnênah, ‘Ka pa, ka ro chan ai chu mi pe rawh,’ a ti a. Tichuan, a sum chu an hnênah a sem ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ni rei lo tê-ah a fapa naupang zâwk chuan a chan ai zawng zawng chu a la khâwm vek a, ram dang hla takah a kal ta a; chutah chuan nuam tâwlin a intlakral ta mai mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A sum neih a deh ral vek hnuin chu ramah chuan ṭâm nasa tak a lo tla a, ei tûr a tlachham ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi rama chêng mi pakhat a bêl ta a, ani chuan a lo lamah vawk rual enkawl tûrin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, vawk chawte chu ei tak a nâp a, tu man ei tûr an pe si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tin, a han inhriat chhuah veleh, ‘Ka pa hlawhfate ei sên loh nei an tam tehlul vei nên, kei lah hetah rilṭâmin ka thi mai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tho vang a, ka pa hnênah ka kal ang a, a hnênah, ‘Ka pa, vâna mi chungah leh i chungah ka lo tisual ta a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I fapaa vuah tlâk ka ni ta lo, i hnêna inhlawhfa pakhat angin mi chhawr ve rawh, ka ti ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tichuan, a tho va, a pa hnênah a kal ta a. Hla taka a la awm laiin a pa chuan a lo hmu a, a khawngaih ta êm êm a, a tlân a, a va pawm a, a fâwp ta ngawih ngawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A fapa chuan, ‘Ka pa, vâna mi chungah leh i chungah thil ka tisual a ni e, i fapaa vuah tlâk ka ni ta lo,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pa erawh chuan a bawihte hnênah, ‘Kawr ṭha ber kha han la thuai ula, hâktîr rawh u, zungbun buntîr ula, pheikhawk pawh buntîr rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />bâwngno châwmthau kha han kai ula, talh rawh u; hlim takin ruai i ṭheh ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />He ka fapa hi a thi a, a lo nung leh ta a; a bo va, kan hmu leh ta a nih hi,’ a ti a. Tichuan, hlim takin an awm ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“A fapa upa zâwk chu lovah a feh a, a lo haw a, in a thlen dâwn chuan thil tum ri leh lâm thâwm chu a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh pakhat a ko va, ‘Chu, eng nge ni ta?’ tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘I nau a lo hâwng a, dam taka a hmuh leh avângin i pain bâwngno châwmthau a talh a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, a thinur a, inah chuan a lût duh ta lo va. A pa chu a va chhuak a, a rawn thlêm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A pa chu a chhâng a, ‘Ngai rawh, kumkhaw hei leh chen sal chhawrin mi chhawr a, i thupêk lah ka awih lo ngai hek lo; chuti chung pawhin ka ṭhiante nêna intihhlimna tûr kêltê takngial pawh mi pe ngai si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, he i fapa, nawhchizuarte hnêna i sum khawhral vektu hi a lo hâwng a, bâwngno châwm thau i lo talhsak si,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, ‘Ka fapa, ka hnêna awm reng i ni a, ka neih zawng zawng hi i ta alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />He i nau, thi tawh kha a lo nung leh ta a ni, a bo tawh kha kan hmu leh ta a nih hi; hlim tak leh lâwm taka awm tûr rêng alâwm,’ a ti a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Mi hausa pakhatin sum enkawltu a nei a, chu mi chuan a sum a khawhralsak mai mai a ni tiin, a hnênah an hêk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chu a ko va, ‘I chungchâng thu ka hriat hi engtizia nge? I sum enkawl ziakna bu chu han la rawh; sum enkawltuah i ṭang thei tawh lo vang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu sum enkawltu chuan a rilruin, ‘Ka puin sum enkawltu ka nihna mi bân dâwn hi, engtin nge ka tih ang? Lei laih ka peih si lo, kut dawh lah ka zak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sum enkawltua mi bân huna miten an ina mi awmtîr theih dân tûr ka hre ta,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, a pu leibatute chu pakhat khatin a ko va, a hmasa ber hnênah chuan, ‘Ka pu hnênah eng zât nge i bat?’ a ti a. Ani chuan, ‘Hriak ṭîn za,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘I ziakna lehkha hi la la, ṭhu la, sawmnga tih ziak rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi dang hnênah, ‘Nang eng zât nge i bat kha?’ a ti a. Ani chuan ‘Buh ṭîn sânghnih leh zahnih leh sawmnga’ a ti a. Ani chuan, ‘I ziakna leh kha hi la la, ṭîn sâng khat leh zariat tih ziak rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A pu chuan sum enkawltu sual fin thiamzia chu a fak ta a, êng fate aiin tûnlai mite hi khawvêl thilah chuan an fing zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka hrilh a che u, khawvêl sum lem hian in tân ṭhian siam rawh u; sum a ral hnuah chatuan rama lawm luh in ni thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlêm te chunga rinawm chu tam tak chungah pawh a rinawm ṭhîn; tlêm tê chunga rinawm lo chu tam tak chungah pawh a rinawm ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khawvêl sum chungah mah in rinawm loh chuan, tu nge sum tak chu kawltîr ngam ang che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi dang ta chungah mah rinawm lo chu, in ta tûr ngei pawh tu nge pe ang che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh tu mahin hotu pahnih rawng an bâwl kawp thei lo; pakhat huain pakhat an duh emaw a ni ang a; a nih loh leh pakhat chu an ngaina ang a, pakhat an hmusit ang. Pathian rawng leh sum rawng in bâwl kawp thei lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Farisai, tangka ngaihlututen chûng thu chu an hriatin Isua chu an nuihzat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An hnênah, “Mi mit hmuha mi fel anga lang mai in ni e; mahse, Pathianin in rilru chhûng a hre si a. Mihringte ngaihsân hi Pathian hmuha tenawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Johana a lo kal hma zawng kha chuan Dân leh zâwlneite thu kha hman tûr a ni a; chuta chinah erawh chuan Pathian ram Chanchin Ṭha hril a ni a, mi tinin luh tumin an bawh ta huai huai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, Dân thu pakhat tê pawh a bo ai chuan lei leh vân boral hi a awl zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Nupui maa, mi dang nei tawh phawt chu an uire a ni, mi nupui mâk hnu nei apiang pawh an uire a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Mi hausa deuh pakhat hi a awm a, puan senduk leh puan zai sîn a inbel a, ni tin nuamsa takin a awm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A kawngkapui bulah chuan mi rethei tak pakhat, a hming Lazara, pân bawm khah lûk chu an muttîr ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />mi hausa dawhkân ata ei nawi tlate chu ei a châk a, uite lah chuan a pân an rawn liahsak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi rethei chu a thi a, Abrahama ângchhûngah vântirhkohten an kalpui ta a. Mi hausa pawh chu a thi a, an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mitthi khuaah hrehawm tak a tuar a; a han vânvadâk a; hla takah, Abrahama chu, a ângchhûnga Lazara awm nên, a han hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a au va, ‘Ka pa Abraham, mi khawngaih la, Lazara kha, a kut zung hmâwr tuiah chiah se, ka lei tidai tûrin han tîr teh, he meialhah hian ka na êm êm a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Abraham erawh chuan, ‘Ka fapa, nangin, i dam laiin thil ṭha hlîr i chang a, chutiang bawkin Lazaran thil ṭha lo hlîr a chan kha hre reng ta che; tûnah zawng ani chu thlamuang takin hetah a awm ta a, nang zawng i na a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chu lo rêngah, heta ṭanga nangni hnêna kal tumte emaw, kha lam aṭanga kan hnên lama lo kal tumte emaw, an kal kai theih loh nân leikak nasa tak kan inkârah a awm a ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘A nih leh, ka Pa, ani chu ka pa inah kaltîr tûr talin ka ngên a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pianpui mipa panga ka nei a, he na tuarna hmunah hian an lo kal ve dah ang e, ṭhahnemngai takin hrilh teh se,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abrahama chuan, ‘Mosia leh zâwlneite an nei alâwm, an thu ngaithla ang hmiang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘Ka Pa Abraham, ni lo ve, mitthi zînga mi meuh an hnênah kal sela an sim ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘Mosia leh zâwlneite thu an awih loh chuan, mitthi zînga mi meuh tho leh thu pawh an awih chuang lo vang,’ a tihsan a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte hnênah, “Tlûknate hi awm lo thei a ni lo; nimahsela, a awmtîrtu chung chu a pik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hêng mi tête zînga pakhat pawh hi a tihtlûk ai chuan chhangphut râwtna lung lian pui a nghâwngah awrhtîra, tuifinriata thlâk ni se a tân a ṭha zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Fîmkhur rawh u, i unauvin i chunga thil a tihsual chuan zilh rawh, a sim chuan ngaidam rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni khatah i chunga vawi sarih thil a tihsualin vawi sarih, ‘ka sim e,’ tia i lam a lo hawi chuan i ngaidam tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tirhkohten Lalpa hnênah chuan, “Kan rinna min tihpunsak rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Anṭam chi fang khat tluk rinna nei ula chuan, he thingtheihmu kûng hnênah hian, ‘Inphawi la, tuifinriatah insawn rawh,’ in ti ang a, in thu a awih mai tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Nangni zîngah tu hian nge bawih neia, lei leta feh emaw, berâm vênga kal emaw, a lo hâwn veleh, ‘Lo kal la, chaw rawn kîl nghâl rawh,’ lo ti ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Ka ei tûr siam rawh, inthuam la, ka ei kham hma chu mi lo vil rawh; chumi hnuah nangin i la ei ve ang chu,’ a ti zâwk dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In thu anga a tih avângin in bawih chu lâwmthu in hrilh ngai êm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin nangni pawh thupêk zawng zawng in tih zawh vek hnuin, ‘Bawih ṭangkai lo kan ni e, kan tih tûr rêng chauh kan ti a nih hi,’ ti ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem a pan pah chuan Samari leh Galili inrinaah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khaw pakhata a luh dâwnin phâr sâwm a lamah an lo kal a; hla feah an ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />an au va, “Isu, Hotupa, min khawngaih rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anni chu a han hmuh chuan, “Kal ta ula, puithiamte va inentîr rawh u,” a ti a. Chutia an kal lai chuan an lo thianghlim ta hlâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An zînga pakhat chuan a dam ta tih a inhriat veleh aw ring taka Pathian fak chungin a kîr leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Isua ke bulah chuan a va bawkkhup a, lâwmthu a hrilh ta a. Chu mi chu Samari mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isua chuan a lo bia a, “Mi sâwm kha in lo thianghlim ta vek a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pakuate kha khawiah nge? He awze mi chauh lo hi Pathian fak tûra lo kîr leh pakhat mah an awm na nge?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, a hnênah, “Tho la, kal rawh, i rinna hi i dam phah ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Farisai-ten Pathian ram lo thlen hun tûr an zawh chu a chhâng a, an hnênah, “Pathian ram lo thleng chu mita hmuh chi a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘En teh u, heta hi,’ emaw, ‘sawta saw,’ emaw an ti hek lo vang. Ngai teh u, Pathian ram chu in zîngah hian a awm zâwk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Mihring Fapa dam lai hunte hi ni khat tal hmuh in duh ni a lo la thleng dâwn; nimahsela, in hmu si lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In hnênah, ‘En teh u, sawta saw le,’ emaw, ‘en teh u, heta hi le,’ emaw an la ti ang; kal chhuak suh ula, zui duh hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihring Fapa lo kal ni chuan, kâwlphein kâwlkil a dêt tawn zawr zawr ang hi a la ni dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, tûnlai mite hian an hnâwl ang a, thil tam tak a tuar hmasa zet tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nova hun laia thil awm dân ang khân Mihring Fapa lo kal ni-ah pawh a la awm ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nova lawnga a luh ni thleng khân mite chuan an eiin an bâr a, nupui pasal an innei a; tui a lo lian a, an zaa a rawn tihboral tâk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Chutiang bawkin Lota dam laiin thil a awm kha; an eiin an in a, an leiin an hralh a, thil an phun a, in an sa a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />nimahsela, Sodom khua ata Lota a chhuah ni chuan vân aṭangin mei leh kât a sûr a, an za-in a tihhlum vek kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mihring Fapa lo kal hun chuan chutiang bawk chu a la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan in chungah mi an awm chuan, in chhûnga sum chuh tûrin chhuk suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lova awm chu hâwng hek suh se. Lota nupui hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Mahni nun chhan tum apiang chuan an chân ang a, mahni nun chân apiang chuan an hum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Ka hrilh a che u, chumi zânah chuan mi pahnih khum khatah an mu ang a, pakhat chu kal bopui a ni ang a, pakhat chu hnutchhiah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hmeichhe pahnihin buh an dêng ang a, pakhat chu lâk a ni ang a, pakhat chu hnutchhiah a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Anni chuan an lo chhâng a, “Lalpa, khawiah maw?” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Sa ruang awmna apiangah mulukawlhte pawh an awm khâwm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, beidawng lova ṭawngṭai fan fan tûr a nihzia tehkhin thuin a hrilh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Khaw engah emaw rorêltu pakhat a awm a; Pathian a ṭih lo va, mihring lah a pawisa hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi khuaah chuan hmeithai pakhat a awm a, ‘Ka khingpui nêna kan thubuai min chinfelsak rawh,’ tiin a hnênah a lo kal chhên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan eng emaw chhûng chu a lo duh lo va, nakinah erawh chuan a rilruin, Pathian ṭih lovin mihring pawisa lo mah ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />he hmeithai hian mi tibuai êm a, ka tihfelsak mai teh ang; chuti lo chu a lo kal fo âwm si a, a ninawm lutuk dâwn,’ a ti a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a sawi zêl a, “Rorêltu fel lo thu sawi chu hre rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A mi thlan, a chhûn a zâna amah autute thu chu Pathian chuan a chinfelsak thuai dâwn lâwm ni? A muangchâng dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, a rawn chinfelsak thuai ang. Amaherawhchu, Mihring Fapa hian a lo kal hunah khawvêlah rinna a rawn hmu ang em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Fel inti hlea, mi dangte hmusit ṭhînte hnênah he tehkhin thu hi a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mi pahnih tempulah ṭawngṭai tûrin an chho va; pakhat chu Farisai a ni a, pakhat chu chhiahkhawntu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Farisai chu a ding a, hetiang hian a ṭawngṭai a, ‘Aw Pathian, mi dang anga mi bum hmang, Dân bawhchhia, uire leh he chhiahkhawntu ang pawh hi ka nih loh avângin lâwmthu ka hrilh a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chawlhkâr tin vawi hnih chaw ka nghei ziah a, ka neih apiangah sâwma pakhat ka pe ṭhîn,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chhiahkhawntu erawh chu hnung feah a ding a, vân lam pawh a en ngam lo va, ‘Aw Pathian, kei mi sual hi mi khawngaih rawh,’ tiin a âwm a inchûm a inchûm ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ka hrilh a che u, a hmasa aiin chu mi zâwk chu thiam changin a in lamah a haw thla ta a. Inngaihlu apiang an tlâwm ang a, inngaitlâwm apiang chawimawi an ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A deh atân nausênte lam pawh an rawn hruai a, zirtîrte erawh chuan an lo hnar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan anni chu a ko va, “Naupangte ka hnênah han kaltîr ula, hnar tawh suh u; Pathian ram chu hetiang mite ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, Pathian ram chu naupang anga lâwm lo apiang tu mah a chhûngah an lût tawp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, hotu pakhatin a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu Ṭha, chatuan nun ka chan theih nân eng nge ka tih ang?” tiin a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Isuan, “Engati nge Ṭha mi tih? Tu mah ṭha an awm lo, Pathian chauh lo chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thupêkte chu i hria alâwm uire suh, tual that suh, ru suh, dâwtin hêk suh, i nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh, tihte hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Chûng zawng zawng chu ka tleirâwl chhuah tirh ata ka zâwm ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chu chu a hriatin Isuan a hnênah, “Kawng khat i la bâk e; i neih zawng zawng hralh la, pachhiate sem rawh; chutichuan, vânah ro i nei dâwn nia; tin, lo kal la, mi zui ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chûng thu a han hriat chuan a lungngai ta hle a, mi hausa tak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Isuan ani chu a hmuhin, “Sum ngahte tân Pathian rama luh a va harsa êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian rama mi hausa an luh aiin, hriau benga sanghâwngsei luh tlang a âwl zâwk si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A lo ngaithlatute chuan, “Chuti chu tu nge chhandam ni thei ang le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Mihring tih theih loh hi Pathian chuan a ti thei asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Petera chuan, “Ngai teh, kan in leh lo kalsanin kan zui ta che a,” a han ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isuan, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, Pathian ram avânga in emaw, nupui emaw, unaute emaw, nu leh pa emaw, fate emaw kalsan tawh phawt chuan tûnah ngei pawh hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a aia tam daih an hmu ngei ang, hun lo la thleng tûra chatuan nunna nên,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Sâwmpahnihte chu a hruai hrang a, an hnênah, “Ngai teh u, Jerusalem-ah kan chhoh dâwn hi; Mihring Fapa chungchâng thu zâwlneite hmanga ziak zawng zawng kha a thleng kim dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jentail-te hnênah an hlân ang a; anni chuan an lo nuihzat ang a, zahthlâk takin an sawisa ang; chil an chhâk ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />an vua ang a, an tihlum ang; ni thum ni-ah a tho leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chûng thu chu a ngaihna an hre lo, an laka thup a ni a, a thu sawi chu an man lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jeriko khua a lo thlen dâwn chuan mitdel pakhat hi kawng sîrah kut dawhin a lo ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mipui kal thâwm a hriat chuan eng nge ni ta tih a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Nazaret Isua a lo kal a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tichuan, “Isu, Davida Fapa, mi khawngaih rawh,” tiin a au ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kal hmasate chuan an hau va, ngawi tûra an tih pawhin a hma aia ringin, “Davida Fapa, mi khawngaih rawh,” tiin a au zual sauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Isua chu a ding a, a hnêna han hruai tûrin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A kiang hnai a lo thlen chuan, “Eng nge tihsak che ila i duh?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Lalpa, hmuh theih ka duh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tichuan Isuan, “Hmu thei tawh ang che, i rinna hi i dam phah a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Thâwklehkhatan khua a hmu thei ta a. Pathian fak chung zêlin amah chu a zui ve ta a. Mi zawng zawngin chu chu an hmuhin Pathian an fak a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeriko-ah chuan a lût a, a chhûnpelh dâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutah chuan pa pakhat, a hming Zakaia a awm a; chhiahkhawn hotu a ni a, mi hausa tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isua chu tu nge ni tih hmuh a tum a, mipui avâng chuan a hmu thei lo va, pa tawi tak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, a kalna tûr kawngah a tlân khalh a, a en tûrin theipui kûngah a lâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi hmun Isuan a va thlen chuan a dâk a, a hnênah, “Zakai, lo chhuk thuai rawh, vawiin hian i inah ka thleng dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lo chhuk ta sawk sawk a, hlim takin amah chu a thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu chu an hmuhin an za chuan, “Mi sual hnêna thleng tûrin a luh tâk saw,” tiin an phunnawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zakaia chu a ding a, Lalpa hnênah chuan, “Ngai teh, Lalpa, ka sum zâtve pachhiate ka pe ang a; tu thil pawh dik lo taka lâksak ka lo neih chuan a lêt liin ka rûl leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Vawiinah he inah hian chhandamna a lo thleng ta, ani pawh Abrahama fapa a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi bote zawnga chhandam tûrin Mihring Fapa hi a lo kal a ni rêng a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chûng thu chu an ngaihthlâk lai chuan Jerusalem pawh an hnaih tâk avâng leh, Pathian ram chu lo thleng mai dâwna an rin avângin tehkhin thu a sawi ta a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Heti hian a sawi a, “Mi lian pakhat, a lal theihna tûr thu laa lo kîr leh tûrin khaw lam hla takah kal a tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A bawihte sâwm a ko va, rangkachak tangka pakhat a pe ṭheuh va, an hnênah, ‘Ka thang chhûngin lo peipung rawh u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, chu khuaa mite chuan an hua a, ‘He pa hi lal atân kan duh lo ve,’ ti tûrin palai an tîr zui ve nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Lalna thu chu laa a lo kîr leh chuan, tangka a pêk a bawihte kha, an peipun zât hriat nân a kohtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A lo kal hmasa ber chuan, ‘Ka pu, i rangkachak tangka kha sâwmin a pung e,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan, Bawih ṭha, i ti ṭha e, tlêm tê chungah i rinawm a, khaw sâwm chunga hotu-ah ṭhu ang che,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A dawta lo kal pawh chuan, ‘Ka pu, i rangkachak tangka kha pangain a pung e,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘Nang pawh, khaw nga chunga hotu-ah ṭhu rawh,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“A dang pawh a lo kal a, ‘Ka pu, en teh, i rangkachak tangka kha, thlanhrûkna puanin ka lo fûn ṭha khiau asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi khirh tak i nih avângin ka hlau che a ni; i dah loh pawh i la ṭhîn a, i tuh loh pawh i seng ṭhîn si a,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ani chuan, ‘Bawih sual, i ṭawngka chhuak aṭang ngeiin ka thiam lo va che. Mi khirh tak ka niha, ka dah loh pawh ka lâk ṭhina, ka tuh loh pawh ka seng ṭhin i hria maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuti a nih ahnu, ka tangka chu engah nge tangkaa sumdâwngtute hnênah i dah mai loh? Ka lo hâwnin a pung nên keiin ka rawn ṭhîng tûr alâwm,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, a kianga dingte hnênah, ‘A rangkachak tangka kha lâksak ula, rangkachak tangka sâwm neitu kha pe rawh u,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Ka pu, ani zawngin sâwm a nei alâwm,’ an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, a nei apiang an pêk belhchhah ang a, a nei lo chu a neih chhun pawh lâksak a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, hêng, ka hmêlma, an lal atâna mi duh lotute hi, rawn hruai ula, ka hmaah that rawh u,’ a ti a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng thu chu a sawi zawh chuan Jerusalem panin hma a hruai chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Oliv tlâng an tiha awm Bethfage leh Bethani khua a thlen dâwnin zirtîrte zînga pahnih a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Kan hma zâwn khuaah sâwn va kal ta ula, in va luhin sabengtung no thlun, tu ma la chuan ngai lohna in va hmu ang; phelh ula, han kai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Miten, ‘Engah nge in phelh tâk mai?’ an tih che u chuan, ‘Lalpan a mamawh a ni,’ tiin chhâng ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, a tirhte chu an kal ta a, an hnêna a sawi ang ngeiin an va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sabengtung chu an phelh lai chuan a neitute chuan, “Sabengtung kha engah nge in phelh tâk mai?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Lalpan a mamawh a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Isua hnênah an rawn kai a, sabengtung chungah chuan an puante an phah a, a chungah Isua chu an chuantîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A kalkawngah chuan an puante an phah zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jerusalem thlen dâwn hnaih, Oliv tlâng liam thlâk dâwnah chuan zirtîrho zawng zawng chu thil mak an hmuh zawng zawngte avângin an lâwm a, aw ring takin an au va, Pathian an fak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Lalpa hminga lal lo kal chu Fakin awm rawh se, Vânah rem lêng sela, Chungnungbera hnênah ropuina awm rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mipui zînga Farisai ṭhenkhat erawh chuan a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, i zirtîrte hi khap rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Ka hrilh a che u, hêngho hi an ngawih chuan hêng lung tal hi an au chhuak ang,” a tihsan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, a lo hnaih deuhva, khawpui a han hmuh chuan a ṭah ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Aw, nang lul hian vawiinah tal hian muanna kawng hi hre hman hrâm la ṭha tûr!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />I râlten leikulh an siam hnan hun che a lo thleng dâwn, an hual ang chia, kil tin aṭangin an bei dâwn a che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />i chhûnga fanaute nên lam an paih thal dêr ang che u; i chhûngah lung intiang rêng rêng an zuah lo vang, Pathianin a rawn kan lai che i hriat loh avângin chûng chu i chungah a lo thleng dâwn,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tempulah chuan a va lût a, englo zuartute chu a hnawt chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />an hnênah, “ ‘Ka in chu ṭawngṭaina in a ni ang,’ tih ziak a ni a, nangni erawh chuan suamhmangte pûkah insiam tâk zâwk hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ni tin Tempulah chuan a zirtîr ṭhîn a, puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute chuan, vântlâng hotute nên, amah tihboral an tum a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />nimahsela, mipuiten a thu ngaihthlâk an kham theih loh avângin a tih dân tûr an hre thei lo a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat chu Tempula Chanchin Ṭha hrila a zirtîr lai chuan puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute chu, upate nên a hnênah an lo chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Eng thuneihnain nge hêng thil hi i tih? Tu-in nge thu pe che min hrilh rawh,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Kei pawhin thu ka zâwt ve ang che u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Johana baptisma kha, vâna mi thu nge mihring thu, min hrilh rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An inberâwn a, ‘Vâna mi thu kan tih chuan, ‘engah nge a thu in awih loh,’ min ti si ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘leia mi thu,’ kan tih lahin mipui hian an za-in lungin min dêng mai awm si a, Johana chu zâwlnei ni ngeiah an pawm tlat hlawm si,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, “Khawi lam zâwk thu nge kan hre lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isua chuan, “Kei pawhin tu thuin nge hêng thil hi ka tih ka hrilh bîk lo vang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vântlâng hnênah he tehkhin thu hi a hrilh ta a: “Mi pakhatin grep huan a siam a, huan enkawltute a thlawh hlawhtîr a; ram dangah rei tak a thang bo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A lawh hun chuan a chan ai la tûrin bawih pakhat huan enkawltute hnênah chuan a tîr a; nimahsela, huan enkawltute chuan an lo vêl a, kut ruakin an hâwtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawih dang a tîr leh a, chu pawh chu an lo vêl a, zahthlâk takin an sawisa a, kut ruak bawkin an hawtîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ṭum thumnaa a tirh lek phei chu, thisen an lo chhuahsak a; huan ata an theh chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Grep huan neitupa chuan, ‘Engtin nge ka tih ang aw? Ka fapa duh tak hi ka tîr mai teh ang; ani hi zawng an lo zah êm ang chu maw,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan enkawltute chuan an lo hmuhin, ‘He mi hi ro luahtu tûr chu a ni, i that ang u khai, keinin a ro chu kan nei hlauh dâwn nia,’ an ti hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Grep huan ata chu an theh chhuak a, an tihlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, grep huan neitupa chuan engtin nge anni chu a rawn tih ang? A lo kal ang a, huan enkawltute chu a rawn tiboral ang a, huan chu mi dangte a pe ang,” a ti a. Thu ngaithlatute chuan, “Chu êm chu ni lo ve!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, anniho chu a en a, “In satute lung duh loh kha, Chu ngei chu a kil lung ṭangkai ber a lo ni si,’ tih ziak hi eng tihna nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chu lung chunga tlu apiang an keh sawm ang a, a delh lek phei chu a râwt dip ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Dân zirtîrtute leh puithiam lalte chuan, chu tehkhin thu chu anmahni demin a sawi tih an hriat avângin man nghâl mai an duh a; amaherawhchu, vântlâng an hlau si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, remchâng an melh ta rân a: Ramawptu rorêlna leh a thuneihnaah an thlen theih nân a ṭawng sual palh man tûrin enthlatu, mi dik anga lang tûrin an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chûng mite chuan, “Zirtîrtu, i thu sawi leh i thu zirtîr hi a dik tih kan hria; tu mah zah bîk nei chuang lovin Pathian thu dik tak i zirtîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kaisara hnênah chhiah chawi tûr kan ni nge ni lo?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An ngamthlêm a ni tih a hmu tlang a, an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Duli mi han entîr teh u. Tu lem leh tu hming nge chuang?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Kaisara,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani chuan, “A nih ahnu, Kaisara ta chu Kaisara pe ula, Pathian ta chu Pathian pe ta che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan vântlâng hmaa a thu sawia man an tum chu an hlawhchham ta a; a chhânna chu mak an ti hle a, an ngawi ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sadukai-ho, ‘thawhlehna a awm lo,’ tite zînga ṭhenkhat Isua hnênah an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Zirtîrtu, Mosian, ‘Tu pawh nupui nei si, fa nei lovin thi sela, a unaupa chuan a nupui chu rochungin a unaupa tân chi a thlahsak tûr a ni,’ tiin min ziaksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw le, unau mipa pasarih an awm a, a upa ber chuan nupui a nei a, fa nei lovin a thi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a pahnihna chuan a rochung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />pathumna pawhin; chutiangin pasarihte chuan an rochung ṭheuh va, fa nei lovin an thi zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan hmeichhia pawh chu a thi ve ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />tichuan, thawhlehnaah chuan chu nu chu tu nupui ber nge ni ang? An pasarih khân nupuiah an nei ṭheuh si a?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lalpan an hnênah, “He khawvêl mite hi nupui pasal an innei ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />khawvêl lo la awm tûra thawhlehnaa tel tlâka ruatte erawh chu nupui pasal an innei dâwn tawh hlei nêm;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />thih pawh an thi leh thei dâwn tawh lo, vântirhkohte ang an ni; thawhlehna changtute an ni a, Pathian fate an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mitthi kaihthawh thu chu Mosia pawhin a tilang alâwm. Hnimbuk meialh thu-ah khân Lalpa chu, ‘Abrahama Pathian, Isaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian,’ tia a sawi kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ani chu mitthite Pathian a ni lo va, mi nungte Pathian a ni zâwk e. Ani tân chuan an nung vek a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Dân zirtîrtu ṭhenkhat chuan, “Zirtîrtu, i sawi dik hle e,” an lo ti bawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />thu dang chu an zâwt ngam tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />An hnênah, “Krista chu Davida fapa engtiziaa ti nge an nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Fakna Hla bu-ah Davida ngeiin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />‘Lalpa chuan ka Lalpa hnênah, ka ding lamah lo ṭhu rawh, I hmêlmate i ke nghahchhanah ka han siam ang e,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Davidan ani chu, ‘Lalpa,’ a tih si chuan, engtin nge a fapa a nih theih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Vântlâng hriatin a zirtîrte hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Dân zirtîrtute lakah fîmkhur rawh u. Anni chuan kawrfual haa lên vêl an chîng a, dâwr hmuna chibai bûk an ngaina a, sunagog-a ṭhutna langsâr ber leh ruai ṭhehna hmuna ṭhutna ṭha ber an ngiat ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hêngho, hmeithai sum ei zawhsaka, mi hmuh atân maia rei tak tak ṭawngṭai chîng site hian hremna an tuar nasa ber ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thawhlâwm bâwma mi hausate thawhlâwm thlâk chu a thlîr reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmeithai rethei tak pakhatin dâr pawisa pahnih a rawn thlâk ve chu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, he hmeithai rethei tak hian mi dang zawng ai khân a thlâk tam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi dangte hi chuan an neih liama mi an rawn thlâk a, ani erawh hi chuan tlachham chungin, intunnunna tûra a neih chhun chu a rawn thlâk a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lung mawi tak tak leh thilpêk khâwma Tempul an chei mawizia thu mi ṭhenkhatin an sawi laiin Isuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hêng in thil hmuhte hi, lung intiang rêng rêng hi pakhat mah tihchim lohva hnutchhiah a awm loh hun a lo thleng dâwn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, chûng chu engtikah nge a lo awm ang? Chûng lo thlen dâwn hun chhinchhiahna thil mak eng eng nge awm ang?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hruai bo in nih loh nân fîmkhur rawh u. Ka hming chhâlin, ‘Keimah hi ka ni,’ ‘a hun a thleng dâwn ta,’ tiin mi tam tak an lo chhuak ang; an hnung zui suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Indo ri te leh hel vânga buai thâwmte in hriat hunin, hlauvin mangang suh ang che u; chûng chu thleng hmasa tûr rêng a ni, hun tâwp erawh chu a ni nghâl mai lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Hnam hrang hrang an indo vang a, sawrkâr hrang leh sawrkâr hrang an indo bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lîr a nghîng vak vak ang a, hmun hrang hrangah ṭâm a tla ang a, hrite a lêng bawk ang; vân ata hlauhawmte leh chhinchhiahna mak tak tak a lo awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng thilte chu a lo thlen hmain an man ang che u a, sunagog-ah te hruaiin tân inah te an khung ang che u a, an tiduhdah dâwn che u a ni. Ka hming avângin lalte leh Ramawptute hmaah an hruai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka thuhretute in nih târlanna remchâng a ni hlauh dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhânna tûr ngaihtuah lâwk a ngai lo tih hre sa rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />in khingpuite tluk loh tûr leh hnial theih loh tûr finna leh mi chhân thiamna keiin ka pe dâwn si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />In nu leh pate, in unaute, in laichînte leh in ṭhiante hial pawhin an mantîr ang che u a; a ṭhen phei chu an tihlum ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hming avângin mi tinin an hua ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, in samzai pakhat pawh a boral lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhel takin ding tlat ula; tichuan, in him ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Sipaihoten Jerusalem an hual in hmuh hun chuan, a chhiat a hnai ta tih hria ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan Judai rama awmte chu tlângramahte tlân se; khawpui chhûnga awmte chuan chhuahsan sela, thingtlânga awmte chu a chhûngah lût suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chûng nite chu hremna ni chu a ni e, thu ziak zawng zawng a thlen kim nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chûng huna nau paite leh nauno pawmte chu an va khawngaihthlâk dâwn êm! He ramah hian hrehawm nasa tak a thleng dâwn si a, he chite chungah hian thinurna a lo thleng dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khandaiha sâm an ni ang a, Jentail ram tinah sala hruai darhin an awm ang; tin, Jentail-te hun a tâwp hma zawng Jerusalem hi Jentail-te rah beh a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tin, ni-ah te, thlaah te, arsi-ah te khian chhinchhiahna mak tak tak a lo awm ang a; leiah pawh tuifinriat fâwn leh rûm hum hum an hriatin hnam tin tihngaihna hre lovin an mangang ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vân thiltihtheihnate chu tihnghîn a ni ang a, khawvêla thil hlauhawm lo thleng tûr an suangtuahin, hlauva thlabârin mite an thidang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan Mihring Fapa hi thiltihtheihna leh ropuina nasa tak nên chhûm zînga lo kal an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng thil chu a lo thlen chuan en chho ula, dâk chhuak ang che u; in tlanna chu a lo hnai ta a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An hnênah tehkhin thu a sawi bawk a, “Theipui kûng leh thing dangte pawh hi en teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A lo chawr no in hmuhin nipui a lo thaw ṭan ta tih in hre mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin nangni pawhin chûng zawng zawng lo thleng in hmuh hun chuan, Pathian ram chu a lo hnai ta tih hre mai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thu dik ka hrilh a che u, chûng thil zawng zawng chu a lo thlen hma loh chuan tûnlai mite hi an ral hman lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lei leh vân a ral ang a, ka thu erawh chu a ral tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Tichuan, nawmsak bâwl te, zu ruih te, ni tin khawsak engtona te in rilrua a khah lutuk loh nân fîmkhur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thanga âwk phut ang maiin a rawn nang dah ang che u. Lei pum pui chunga chêngte chungah chutiangin a lo thleng dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chûng thil lo thleng tûrte tuar chhuaka, Mihring Fapa hmaa in din theih nân eng lai pawhin ngaihvenin ṭawngṭai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chhûnah chuan Tempulah a zirtîr a, zânah erawh chuan a chhuak a, Oliv tlâng an tihah chuan a riak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng pawh a thu ngaithla tûrin zîngah Tempulah an lo kal ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chhang dawidim telh loh kût, Kalhlên Kût an tih chu a lo hnai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute chuan amah tihhlum dân tûr kawng an dap ta a; vântlâng an hlau si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sâwmpahnihte zînga chhiar tel, Juda, Iskariota an tiha chhûngah Setana a lût a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tichuan, a va kal a, puithiam lalte leh vêngtu sipai hotuten an man dân tûr a va sawipui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chu an lo lâwm hle a, pawisa pêk an tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani pawh chuan a remti a, mipui awm loh laia mantîrna hun remchâng a zawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chhang dawidim telh loh kût ni, Kalhlên Kût berâmno an talh ni chu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Petera leh Johana chu a tîr a, “Kalhlên Kût chaw kan ei tûr va buatsaih rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anni chuan “Khawiah nge va buatsaih ila i duh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ngai teh u, khawpuia in va luhin pa pakhat, hlumbêla tui chawiin a rawn tâwk ang che u, a luhna inah zui lût ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, in neitupa hnênah, ‘Zirtîrtuin, ka zirtîrte nêna Kalhlên Kût chaw kan eina tûr pindan chu khawiah nge, a ti a che,’ ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chuan pindan chungnung zau tak, engkim awm a kawhhmuh ang che u; chutah chuan buatsaih rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan an kal a, an hnêna a sawi ang ngei khân an va hmu a, Kalhlên Kût chaw chu an buatsaih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a ei a lo hun chuan ani leh a zirtîrte chuan chaw chu an kîl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An hnênah, “Ka tuar hmain he Kalhlên Kût chaw hi eipui che u ka duh tak meuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, Pathian rama a tak tak a thlen hma loh chu kût chaw hi ka ei leh tawh dâwn lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, no a la a, lâwmthu a sawi zawhin, “Hei hi la ula, in rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, tûn a chinah Pathian ram a lo thlen hma loh chu grep rah tui hi ka in leh dâwn tawh lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, chhang a la a, lâwmthu a sawi zawhin a phel a, an hnênah a pe a, “Hei hi ka taksa a ni, in tâna pêk chu; min hriat reng nân hetiang hian ti ṭhîn rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zanriah ei zawh chuan chutiang bawkin no chu a la a, “He no hi ka thisena thuthlung thar, in tâna chhuak chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nimahsela, ngai teh u, mi mantîrtu tûr chuan he dawhkân hi a kîl ve reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi Pathian ruat angin a kal dâwn; amaherawhchu, a mantîrtu tûr mihring chung chu a pik e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anni chuan an zîngah chutiang ti tûr chu tu tak ni ang maw, tiin an inzâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An zîngah tu nge ropui bera ngaih tûr ni ang tih inhnialna a lo chhuak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Jentail-ho lalte chu an intilal êm êm a, an chunga thuneitute lah chuan ‘Hotuṭhaa’ tih hming te an invuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangni zîngah zawng chutiang tûr a ni lo ve. In zînga ropui ber chu tê ber angin awm sela, hotu ber chu rawngbâwltu angin awm zâwk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu nge ropui zâwk, chaw kîltu nge a rawngbâwltu? Chaw kîltu chu a ni lo vem ni? Nimahsela, kei zawng in zîngah rawngbâwltu angin ka awm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Harsatna ka tawh chhûng zawng nangnin mi awmpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka Pain ram mi ruatsak ang bawkin kei pawhin ram ka ruatsak a che u; tichuan, ka ramah chuan ka dawhkânah in eiin in bâr ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />lalṭhutthlênga ṭhuin Israel hnam sâwm leh pahnih ro in rêlsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Simon, Simon, ngai teh, Setanan buh thlei angin thlei a tum che u a ni; nimahsela, i rin a bo loh nân ka ṭawngṭaisak a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, i lo hawi kîr leh hunah i unaute tinghet ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Lalpa, i hnênah chuan tâng tûr leh thi tûr pawhin kal ve zêl ka inhuam asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Peter, ka hrilh a che, ‘Ani chu ka hre lo ve,’ tia vawi thum mi phat hma chu zâninah âr a khuang lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An hnênah, “Tangka ip te, iptê te, pheikhawk te keng lova ka tirh che u khân tlâkchham in nei rêng em?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Nei hauh lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Tûnah zawng tangka ip nei chuan keng sela, iptê pawh keng rawh se; khandaih nei lo chuan a puan hralh sela, lei rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka hrilh a che u, ‘Ani chu mi sual zîngah an chhiar tel ta,’ tih Lehkha Thu kha ka chunga thleng ngei tûr a ni. Ka chungthu an ziak kha a thleng kim dâwn ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Lalpa, en teh, hei khandaih pahnih chu a awm e,” an ti a. Ani chuan, “A tâwk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a chhuak a, a dân pângngaiin Oliv tlângah chuan a kal ta a; a zirtîrte pawh chuan an zui ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A hmun a va thlen chuan an hnênah, “Thlêmnaa in luh loh nân ṭawngṭai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Lung den phâk chin vêlah a va kal hrang a, a ṭhingṭhi a, a ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Ka Pa, rem i tih zâwng a nih chuan he no hi mi lâk sawnsak rawh; nimahsela, keima thu ni lovin, nangma thu ni zâwk rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Vân ata vântîrhkoh pakhat, a tiharh tûrin a hnênah a lo lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A thlaphâng êm êm a, ṭhahnemngai lehzualin a ṭawngṭai a; a thlan chu thisen far lian tak angin a far a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A ṭawngṭai zo chu zirtîrte hnênah a lo kal a, an lungngai tawngkhawng muthlu chu a rawn hmu a, an hnênah, “Engati nge in mutthlûk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tho ula, thlêmnaa in luh loh nân ṭawngṭai rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, a la sawi lai mêkin mipui an lo thleng a, Sâwmpahnihte zînga tel Juda an tih khân hma a rawn hruai a, fawh tumin Isua a rawn pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan a hnênah, “Juda, Mihring Fapa hi fâwpin em ni i mantîr dâwn?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A vêla mite chuan thil lo thleng tûr chu an hmuhin, “Lalpa, khandaih kan lek mai dâwn aw?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />An zînga pakhat chuan Puithiam lalber bawih chu a sât a, a beng ding lam a hlawisak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Isua chuan a chhâng a, “Khaih khaih, a tâwk e,” a ti a. A beng chu a khawihsak a, a tidam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Puithiam lalte, Tempul pulis hotute leh upa lo kalte hnênah chuan Isuan, “Suamhmang man tûr ang ziazângin khandaih leh talhtum kengin in lo thawk a ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ni tin Tempulah in zînga ka awm ṭhin lai khân mi man si lo; nimahsela, tûn hi in chêt hun a ni, thim lal chêt hun chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />An man ta a, Puithiam lalber inah an hruai lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Petera chuan hnung feah a zui a. Tin, in hual chhûng kawtlaiah mei an chhêm a, an ṭhu khâwm a, Petera pawh chu an zîngah chuan a ṭhu ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Mei ênga a ṭhu chu chhiahhlawh nula pakhat hian a han hmu a, a en vang vang a, “He pa hi a hnêna awm ve kha a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Ani erawh chuan, “Hmeichhia, ani chu ka hre lo ve,” a ti a, a phat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />A hnu lawkah mi dangin a rawn hmu ve a, “Nang pawh an zînga mi i nih hi,” a ti a. Petera chuan, “Mihring, ka ni awzâwng lo mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Darkâr khat vêl hnuah chuan mi dangin, “He pa hi a hnêna tel kha a nih ngei hi maw, Galili mi a ni alâwm,” a ti tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Petera chuan, “Mihring, i thu sawi chu ka hre hauh lo,” a ti a. A ṭawng lai mêk chuan âr a lo khuang nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Lalpa chu a lo hawi a, Petera chu a en a. Petera chuan “Zâninah âr a khuan hmain vawi thum mi phat ang,” Lalpan a hnêna a tih kha a hre chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Pâwnah a chhuak a, a ṭap ta zawih zawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Isua chelhtute chuan nuihza siam nân an hmang a, an bêng sawk sawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />A mit an tuam a, “Tu nge bêng che, sawi teh,” te an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Ṭawng chhe pui puiin an hau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tin, ni a lo chhuah chuan vântlâng upaho, puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute chu an ṭhu khâwm a; an Sanhedrin-ah chuan Isua chu an rawn hruai a. “Krista chu i nih leh nih loh min hrilh rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Hrilh che u mah ila, in awih chuang lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />zâwt che u mah ila mi chhâng chuang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Nimahsela, tûn aṭang chuan Mihring Fapa hi Pathian thiltihtheihna ding lamah a ṭhu tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />An zavai chuan, “Chu, nang hi Pathian Fapa i ni maw?” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Nangman, ‘i ni’ min ti alâwm le!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Hretu dang tu nge kan ngaih tawh ang? Keimahni ngeiin ama kamchhuak kan hre ta alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />An za chuan an tho va, Pilata hnênah an hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“He mi hian kan chite hel tûrin a fuih a, Kaisara hnêna chhiah chawi a khap a, amah hi Lal, Krista chu niin a insawi tih kan hre chhuak a ni,” tiin an hêk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pilata chuan a hnênah, “Juda-te lal i ni maw?” a ti a. Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Chu, i tih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pilata chuan puithiam lalte leh mipuite hnênah chuan, “He mi chungah hian thu pawi eng mah ka hmu lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, anni chuan, “Hel tûra mite fuihpawrhin Judai ram khaw tinah mi a zirtîr ṭhîn tih kan hria, Galili ramah a ṭan a, hetah pawh a lo thlen tâk hi,” tiin an bei lehzual sauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pilatan chu chu a han hriat chuan Galili mi a nih leh nih loh a zâwt a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Heroda biala mi a ni tih a hriat chuan Heroda hnênah a tîr ta a; ani pawh chu Jerusalemah a lo awm lai tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Herodan Isua a lo hmuhin a lâwm hle a, a chanchin a hriat fo avângin hmuh a châkna a rei hle tawh rêng a; a thil mak tih eng emaw tal hmuh pawh a beisei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thu tam tak a zâwt a; nimahsela, a eng mah a chhâng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute pawh chu an ding ve a, an hêk chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Heroda pawh chuan, a sipaite nên, Isua chu an hmusit hle a, nuihza siam nân an hmang a, puan ropui tak an sintîr a, Pilata hnênah a tîr kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pilata leh Heroda chu tûn hma chuan an intai hle ṭhîn a, chumi ni aṭang chuan an inngeih leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pilata chuan puithiam lalte leh Dân zirtîrtute leh vântlângho chu a ko khâwm a, an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“He mi hi mite hel tûra fuihah in rawn puh a, in hma ngeiah ka chhuahchhâl a, in hêkna thu-ah thil pawi eng mah a khawih ka hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Heroda pawhin a hmu hek lo, kan hnênah a rawn tîr kîr leh ta mai a nih hi. Ngai rawh u, thihna khawp meuh eng mah tih a nei lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tichuan, ka han zilh hlek ang a, ka chhuah mai dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, an za chuan an au rual a, “He mi hi chu tiboral la, Baraba kha min chhuahsak rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu mi chu khawpuia helna avâng leh tual thah avânga tân ina tâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pilata chuan Isua chu chhuah a duh a, an hnênah thu a sawi leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />mahse, “Khêngbet rawh, krawsah khêngbet rawh,” tiin anniho chu an au ta tuar tuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan a vawi thumnaah, “Engah maw? Eng nge a tihsual? Thihna khawp meuh eng mah pawi a khawih ka hmu lo; ka zilh ang a, ka chhuah mai dâwn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anni chu ring takin an au va, krawsa khêngbet tûrin an ngên lui tlat a, an aw chuan a vau dai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pilata chuan an ngên ang chuan thu a titlu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Helna leh tual thah avânga tân ina mi tâng an dîl kha a chhuah a, Isua erawh chu an duh duha tih tûrin a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, an hruai ta a; Simona, Kurini khaw mi, thingtlâng lam aṭanga lo kal chu an man a, Isua hnungah kraws chu an puttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, vântlâng mipui nasa tak leh lungchhiaa ṭap ṭap hmeichhiaten an zui dûl dûl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isua chuan an lam a hawi a, “Jerusalem nute u, mi ṭah suh u, nangmahni leh in fate tân ṭap zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />‘Hmeichhe ching te, nau pai ngai lo pum te, nau hnêk loh hnute te chu a nihlawh e,’ an tih hun a lo thleng dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chûng hunah chuan tlâng hnênah, ‘min delh rawh,’ an ti ang a, mual hnênah pawh, ‘min khuh rawh,’ an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thinghring mah hetiang hian an ti a, a ro chu engtin tak la ti ang maw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tihhlum tûr mi dang, mi sual pahnih a rual chuan an hruai ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Luruh an tih hmun chu an va thleng a; mi sualte pawh chu a ding lamah pakhat, a vei lamah pakhat an khêngbet bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isuan, “Ka Pa, anniho hi ngaidam rawh, an thiltih hi an hre lo a ni e,” a ti a. A silhfênte chu ṭhumvâwrin an insem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vântlângho chuan dingin an thlîr a. Hotute pawh chuan, “Mi dang mah a tidam ṭhîn a, Pathian mi ruata, Krista chu a nih meuh chuan amah pawh intidam ang hmiang,” tiin an ṭawng el a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Sipaihote pawh chuan an nuihzat a, a hnênah an kal a, uain thûr an pe a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Juda-te lal i nih zet chuan intidam ta che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A chungah chuan, “He mi hi Juda-te lal a ni,” tih ziak an târ a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An khenbeh ve mi sual pakhat zâwk pawh chuan a ân khum a, “Krista chu i ni lo vem ni? Intidam la, keini pawh min tidam ve ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nimahsela, pakhat chuan a lo khak a, a zilhhau va, “Pathian meuh pawh i hlau na nge, thuhmun renga an hrem che hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Keini pahnih hi zawng hrem âwm rêng kan ni, kan thiltih man kan hmu a nih hi; he mi hi zawngin eng mah a tisual si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tichuan, “Isu, i ram i thlen hunah mi hre reng ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ani chuan a hnênah, “Thu dik ka hrilh a che, ka hnênah vawiinah hian paradis-ah i awm ve ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chhûn dâr sâwm leh pahnih vêl aṭanga tlai dâr thum thlengin khawvêl a lo thim ta vek a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />ni a êng ta lo va, Tempul chhûng puanzâr chu a laiah a thlêr thla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Isua chu ring takin a au va, “Ka pa, ka thlarau i kutah ka kawltîr a che,” a ti a. Chu chu a sawi zawh chuan a hnuk a chat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Sipai za hotu chuan thil lo thleng chu a hmuhin Pathian a fak a, “He mi hi mitakzet a ni phawt mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Chûng thil en tûra mipui lo kal khâwmte chuan thil lo thleng chu an hmuhin an lungngai a, an âwmte chûm chûmin an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A hmêlhriathote erawh chu hla feah an ding reng a, Galili ram aṭanga amah zuitu hmeichhiate nên khân chûng thil chu an thlîr ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat, a hming Josefa, rorêltu zînga tel, mi dik leh ṭha tak a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ani chuan an rorêl leh an thil tih chu a remtihpui ve lo rêng a. Juda-te khua Arimathai-a awm a ni, Pathian ram beisei ve ṭhîntu a ni bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chu mi chu Pilata hnênah a kal a, Isua ruang a va dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, a la thla a, puan zai sînin a tuam a, tu mah la zalh ngai lohna lung ker thlânah a zalh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Chumi ni chu Juda-te Inrinni a ni a; mahse, Juda-te sabat ni a inṭan lek lek tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Galili ram aṭanga rawn zuitu hmeichheho pawh chuan an zui ve zêl a, thlân leh a ruang an zalh dân chu an en a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tin, an haw a, rimtuite leh hriak rimtuite an siam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thupêk angin sabat ni chuan an châwl a, Pathianni chuan vârṭianah rimtui an siamte chu kengin thlânah chuan an va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlân kawngka ata lung chu lum sawnin an hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />an han luh chuan Lalpa Isua ruang rêng an hmu ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutia hrilhhai taka an awm lai chuan, mi pahnih puan vâr taka inthuam an kiangah an lo ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hlau va, lei bihin an kun tlat a. Chu mite chuan an hnênah, “Engati nge mitthi zîngah mi nung in zawn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hetah a awm tawh lo, kaihthawh a ni ta. Galili rama a awm laia in hnêna a sawi kha hre reng rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Mihring Fapa hi mi sualte kuta mantîr a ni ang a, krawsah an khêngbet ang a, ni thum ni-ah a tho leh tûr a ni,’ a tih ṭhin kha?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thu sawi kha an hre chhuak leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thlân ata chu an hâwng a, Sâwmpakhatte leh mi dangte chu chûng thu chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chûng thu tirhkohte rawn hrilhtute chu Magdala mi Mari te, Joani te, Jakoba nu Mari te leh an zînga kal ve hmeichhe ṭhenkhatte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng thu chu thu tak takah an lo ngaihsak lo va, an awihsak hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Petera erawh chu a tho va, thlânah chuan a va tlân a, kûna a han bih chuan puan zai sîn awmte chauh chu a hmu a; tichuan, thil awm dân chu mak ti tak chungin in lamah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai teh, chumi ni tak chuan an zînga pahnih chu khaw pakhat Emmau an tihah chuan kal tûrin an chhuak a. Chu khua chu Jerusalem aṭanga km. sâwm leh pakhat vêla hla a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil lo thleng zawng zawng chu an sawi dûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutia an titia thu an sawi dun lai chuan amah Isua ngei chuan a rawn hnaih a, an kal tlâng ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />nimahsela, a hmêl an hriat theih loh nân an mit chu tihvaih a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Kal paha in sawi kha eng thu nge?” a ti a. Ngui takin an ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hming Kleopa zâwk chuan a chhâng a, “Nangmah chauh hi i ni âwm e, Jerusalem tlawh si tûnlai chanchin hre lo chu!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Eng chanchin maw?” a ti a. Anni chuan, “E le, Nazaret Isua chanchin hi; Pathian leh mi zawng zawng mit hmuha thu-ah leh thil tiha zâwlnei thiltithei tak chanchin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chu kan puithiam lalte leh kan rorêltuten tihhlum tûrin an pêka, krawsah an khenbeh tâk thu kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keini lahin Israel-te tlantu tûra kha a nih kan lo beisei vei nên. Chu mai pawh a ni lo, vawiin hi a ni thumna a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />kan pâwla hmeichhe ṭhenkhat pawh tûkin zîngah khân thlânah an va kal a, a ruang an va hmu si lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Vântîrhkoh inlâr kan hmu a, chu mite chuan, ‘a nung leh ta an ti,’ te an rawn ti a, min timangang nasa mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kan awmpui zînga ṭhenkhat pawh thlânah an va kal ve a, hmeichheho sawi ang chiah khân thil an va hmu a; mahse, amah chu an hmu bîk si lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Mi â te u, zâwlneite thu sawi tinrêng awih kawnga ngawngte u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kristan chûng thil chu tuarin a ropuinaah a lût tûr a ni rêng lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia aṭanga ṭanin zâwlnei zawng zawng thu chhuiin, Lehkha Thua a chanchin ziakna apiang anmahni a hrilh fiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An kalna tûr khua chu an thleng dâwn ta a; ani erawh chu kal zêl tûr ni âwm takin a lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kâin an chelh a, “Kan hnênah riak ve mai rawh, khua a tlai ta a, ni pawh a tlâk dâwn tawh hi,” an ti a. Tichuan, an hnêna riak tûrin a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zanriah an han kîl ho va, chhang a la a, malsâwmna a sawi a, a phel a, an hnênah a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An mit chu a lo vâr a, a hmêl an hre ta a; ani erawh chu a ral ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Kalkawnga min biak laia Lehkha Thute min hrilh fiah lai khân kan thinlung a harh huai rêng lâwm ni kha?” an inti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tichuan, an tho va, Jerusalem-ah an kîr leh ta nghâl a. Sâwmpakhatte leh an ṭhiante awm khâwm chu an han hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Lalpa chu a lo tho leh ngei alâwm, Simona hnênah pawh a inlâr asin,” an lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Anni pawh chuan kalkawnga thil lo thleng leh chhang a phela, amah an lo hriat tâk dânte chu an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chûng thu chu an sawi laiin Isua ngei chu an zîngah a lo ding a, an hnênah, “In chungah thlamuanna awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Râpthlâk an ti a, an hlau ta êm êm a, thlarau hmuah an inruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Engati nge chuti êm êma in hlauh? Engtizia nge in inngaihtuah buai tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ka kut te, ka kephah te hi en ta che u, keimah ngei kha ka ni alâwm. Mi dek ula, en rawh u; kei mi hmuh ang hian thlarauvin tisa leh ruh a nei hlei nêm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A sawi zawhin a kut te, a kephah te a entîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />an lâwm lutuk chuan an la awih ta lo cheu va; mak an tih êm avângin an hnênah, “hetah englo ei tûr in nei êm?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Sangha hem hmin hrang khat an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A la a, an hmaah chuan a ei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “In zînga ka awm lai khân hêng thu hi ka hrilh ṭhin che u kha, Mosia Dânah te, zâwlnei Lehkhabu-ah te, Fakna Hla bu-ah te ka chanchin an ziak apiang chu a thleng tûr a ni, tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tichuan, Lehkha Thu hrethiam thei tûrin an rilru a hawnsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />An hnênah, “Krista chuan a tuar ngei tûr a ni, ni thum ni-ah mitthi zîng ata a tho leh bawk tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />‘simna leh sual ngaihdamna thu chu Jerusalem-a ṭanin hnam tin hnênah ama hminga hril tûr a ni tih ziak a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hêng thil hi a hretute in ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Pa thil tiam chu in chungah ka rawn tîr dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Chung lam aṭanga thiltihtheihnaa thuam in nih hma loh chuan khawpuiah hian awm reng ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, Bethani dai kiang thlengin a hruai chhuak a, a bân a phar a, anni chu mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chutia mal a sâwm lai chuan anni chu a ṭhen a, vâna hruai chhoh a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Chibai an bûk a, hlim takin Jerusalem-ah an kîr leh ta a; tin, Tempulah chuan Pathian fakin an kal fo ṭhîn a.
  </para>
</usx>
